        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "PlotArea = left:160 bottom:75 top:10 right:30" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "In the episode \"Wikiality\" of The Colbert Report, host Stephen Colbert has instigated his viewers to vandalize articles in humorous ways, once doing so on the Wikipedia article on elephants. \"Weird Al\" Yankovic's character in his video 'White & Nerdy' is seen vandalising the entry for the Atlantic record label with the exclamation \"You suck!,\" after they rescinded permission for a parody." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "A&amp;amp;M Day (Texas A&amp;amp;M University)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Golden Spike Day (1869 – Completion of the First transcontinental railroad&nbsp;– Promontory Summit, Utah)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "National Asian &amp;amp; Pacific Islander HIV/AIDS Awareness Day" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation's Best Performing Governor on Immunization in South-East Nigeria (2012)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Alo (nkè kachasị n'ime ogene ígwè) Alo bụ nkè kachasị n'etiti ogene. Ọdịdị alo dịgasị iche ma ọ nwere ike iru 6 ft. Ngwá ọrụ Alo na-abụkarị otu, ọ bụ ezie nà n'ọnọdụ ndị a na-adịghị ahụkewe, enwere ike ịchọta alo abụọ. &nbsp;" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Kanyé Omari West (ha muru ya na afo 8 Juun 1977) bu onye Amerika na Kwu egwu nke rap. O na bu kwa abu. O wefutara egwu ime The College Dropout na afo 2004. Egwu nor na The College Dropout bu egwu nke madu shi mara ya oma. O wefutara kwa nnokolata abu ndi ozo, nke o kporo Late Registration na afo 2005, Graduation na afo 2007, ye nwefuta nnokolata abu nke ato, 808s & Heartbreak na afo 2008. O ne ji oru ya bu GOOD music i weputa abubu ndi ozo nor na ya. O bu onye kere, na onye were GOOD music. Ihe ozo madu shi ma Kanye West bu \"Dropout Bear\", o bu ihe eguregu nor na ihu nnokolata abu ya ato, na egwu ndi ozo na enyoyo nke egwu o were." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "2003 - Dangerously in Love („Work It Out”, „'03 Bonnie & Clyde”, „Crazy in Love”, „Baby Boy”, „Me, Myself and I”, „Naughty Girl”)" },
        { "cell": "iteration", "text": "Shirō Sasaki (佐々木 史朗, born 1939), Japanese film producer" },
        { "cell": "iteration", "text": "Ọ bụ ezie na ụlọ ọrụ ahụ nwere mmekọrịta dị ogologo na GM na-alaghachi na 1920, ntinye ego mbụ nke GM na-ewere 34% na Isuzu bụ na 1972, mgbe Chevrolet LUV ghọrọ ụgbọ ala Isuzu mbụ e wuru na United States. . Iji gosi mmalite ọhụrụ ahụ, Isuzu rụpụtakwara akara ngosi ọhụrụ maka 1974, nwere ogidi abụọ kwụ ọtọ dị ka ihe nnọchianya nke mkpụrụedemede mbụ na いすゞ (\"Isuzu\").[1] N'afọ 1974 Isuzu webatara Gemini, nke ya na General Motors rụpụtara dị ka T-body Chevrolet Chevette. E rere ụdị gbanwegharịrị na United States dị ka Buick's Opel nke Isuzu, na n'Australia dị ka Holden Gemini. N'ihi nkwado ahụ, a na-eresị ndị ahịa Japan ụfọdụ ngwaahịa GM nke America site na ndị ahịa Isuzu. A na-erekwa Holden's Statesman nwa obere oge (ihe atụ 246) jiri badging Isuzu na Japan n'ime afọ iri asaa.[2] Mbupụ Isuzu mụbara nke ukwuu n'ihi inwe ike iji netwọk GM, site na 0.7% nke mmepụta na 1973 ruo 35.2% site na 1976; nke a ebe mmepụta n'ozuzu ya mụbara ihe karịrị okpukpu anọ n'otu oge ahụ.[3] N'ihi njikọ aka nke GM, ndị nkewa GM dị ugbu a na-ejikwa engines Isuzu (ụfọdụ ụgbọ ala US-ahịa Chevrolet nwere Isuzu powertrains dịka Chevette na ụgbọ ala S10/S15 nke arụpụtara tupu 1985)." },
        { "cell": "iteration", "text": "Yukari Nonomura (野々村 留, Nonomura Yukari) )" },
        { "cell": "iteration", "text": "Ihe ịrịba ama nke ịhụnanya (Japanese: ゆびさきと恋々, Hepburn: Yubisaki to Renren, lit. \"Mkpịsị aka na mmetụta ịhụnanya\") bụ usoro manga Japanese nke Suu Morishita dere ma gosipụta ya. Ọ malitere serialization na akwụkwọ akụkọ Dessert nke Kodansha na Julaị 2019. Dị ka nke Julaị 2024, ewepụtara mpịakọta tankōbon iri na otu. Ngbanwe usoro ihe onyonyo anime nke Ajia-do Animation Works wepụtara sitere na Jenụwarị ruo Maachị 2024." },
        { "cell": "iteration", "text": "Rui Sasaki (佐々木 類, Sasaki Rui; amụrụ n'afọ 1984) bụ onye na-ese enyo si Japan . Ọrụ ya dị na nchịkọta na-adịgide adịgide nke Corning Museum nke enyo." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "N'oge asọmpi World U20, ọ gbara ụkwụ nke abụọ nke agba agba agba agba agba agba agba agba 4x400. Ndị otu Naijiria mebere Johnson Chidera Nnamani, Uko, Opeyemi Deborah Oke na Bamidele Ajayi meriri emume a na asọmpi asọmpi n'oge 3:19.70." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "2006, na-ekere òkè na asọmpi ndị ntorobịa ụwa . Ọ gụchara nke ise na narị anọ&nbsp;m hurdles ikpeazụ mana jisiri ike nyere ndị otu egwuregwu ịgba ọsọ mita 4 × 400 nke ụmụ nwanyị Naijiria aka (gụnyere Folashade Abugan, Joy Eze na Sekinat Adesanyato ) ihe nrite ọlaọcha, na-esetịpụ ndekọ ọhụrụ nke obere ndị Africa nke 3:30.84 maka mmemme ahụ." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "N'afọ 2009 World Championship, ọ ruru 400&nbsp;m na-egbochi ọkara ikpeazụ ma bụrụkwa nke isii n'ozuzu ya na otu mgbagharị ụmụ nwanyị. O debere ndekọ nzuko na Ponce Grand Prix, ebe o meriri na 55.02&nbsp;sekọnd. Odumosu debere ndekọ Naijiria na nzukọ Herculis na Julaị n'afọ 2010, na-agba ọsọ 54.68&nbsp;sekọnd nke ise n'ime ihe mgbochi. Ọ laghachiri iji gbachitere aha ihe mgbochi ya na asọmpi Africa n'afọ 2010, mana ọ ga-enwe afọ ojuju na nrite ọlaọcha n'azụ Hayat Lambarki . Ọ ka ruru n'elu podium na asọmpi, Otú ọ dị, ka ọ na-enyere 4×400 aka&nbsp;m relay otu na ndekọ asọmpi nke 3:29.26. Tinyere Lambarki, a họpụtara Odumosu ka ọ nọchite anya otu ndị Africa na narị anọ&nbsp;m nwere ihe mgbochi n'afọ 2010 IAAF Continental Cup . Ọ kwalitere ndekọ mba ya ruo 54.59&nbsp;Sekọnd na asọmpi ahụ wee nweta nrite ọla ọcha n'azụ Nickiesha Wilson nke Jamaica, na-agba ọsọ maka America." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "O nwere ihe kacha mma nkeonwe 2:02.04 na 800 mita (2003) na 4:28.17 na 1500 mita (2005)." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Na 2015 IAAF World Relays na Nassau, George gbara ụkwụ nke abụọ nke ndi otu 4 × 200 m relay nwetara ihe nrite ọla edo n'ihu ndị otu Jamaica na German. Otu ndị mejupụtara Blessing Okagbare, George, Dominique Duncan na Christy Udoh meriri n'ọsọ 1:30.52 wee kpuchiri ndekọ Afrịka gara aga na mmemme ahụ. Ọ debere nke abụọ n'asọmpi Naijiria n'azụ Patience George wee si otú ahụ mechie ọkwa ya maka asọmpi mba ụwa na 2015 na Beijing. Ọ enweteghi ihe ebe kacha efu na okpomọkụ 400m na Beijing ma ọ banyeghị na ọkara nke ikpeazụ. Ọ du kwara ndị otu relay Nigeria 4 × 400 m gbachara n'ọkwa ise na 4 × 400 m nke ikpeazụ." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Purrier gara ma gụchaa na Mahadum New Hampshire, na-amụ ihe oriri. Na-anọchite anya New Hampshire Wildcats, ọ bụ onye NCAA Division I 11-oge All-American. Na 2018 USA Outdoor Track and Field Championship, nke emere ka ọ gụchara, ọ gụchara nke isii na 1500 mita, na-agba ọsọ nke 4:09.30. Ọ meriri 2018 NCAA Indoor Track & Field Championship na mile ụmụ nwanyị." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Muna Kalameya Durka (Arabic; amụrụ na June 19, 1988) bụ onye Sudanese steeplechase runner. Durka nọchitere anya Sudan na 2008 Summer Olympics na Beijing, ebe ọ sonyere maka asọmpi mbụ ụmụ nwanyị 3000 mita steeplechase. Ọ gbara ọsọ na okpomọkụ nke abụọ megide ndị egwuregwu iri na isii ndị ọzọ, gụnyere Tatyana Petrova nke Russia, onye mechara merie ọla nchara na nke ikpeazụ. Ọ gwụchara ọsọ ahụ n'ọnọdụ nke itoolu site na sekọnd isii n'azụ Sofia Assefa nke Etiopia, na oge nke 9:53.09. Otú ọ dị, Durka enweghị ike ịga n'ihu na nke ikpeazụ, ebe ọ nọ n'ọnọdụ nke iri atọ na asatọ n'ozuzu, ma nọrọ n'okpuru oghere anọ dị mkpa maka agba ọzọ." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "800 mita - 2:02.43 nkeji (2005) - ihe ndekọ mba." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Igwe bụ onye edemede, onye na-emepụta ihe, onye nduzi, onye ọchụnta ego na onye nkụzi. Dịka onye ọsụ ụzọ n'ihe nkiri na ihe nkiri TV nke oge a na Naịjirịa, o nwetara aha mba dịka onye edemede na onye na-emepụta ihe nkiri TV Checkmate na Fuji House of Commotion . Ọrụ Nollywood ya gụnyere Rattle Snake na Violated , nke e mepụtara n'oge ihe nkiri vidiyo nke sinima Naịjirịa. O hiwere BOBTV Expo, ma bụrụkwa onye guzobere na onye isi oche nke ọdụ Top Radio 90.9FM, Amaka Igwe Studios na Q Entertainment Networks." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Sandra Sopụlụchukwu Ezekwesili bụ Nigerian Broadcast Journalist, nakwa Media Personality.Ugbu a ọ bụ ya na-ahụ maka ihe nke a kpọrọ drive time ebe ọ na anọ agụpụta akụkọ nakwa ihe nriba ama megasịrị na Nigeria . Nke ọzọ bụkwa 'Hard Facts' n'ụlọ ọrụ Nigeria Info 99.3FM dị na Lagos, Nigeria." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Sandra si n'ụlọ CoolFM di na Port Harcourt pụọ wee ga n'ụlọ ọrụ ọzọ a kọrọ Nigeria Info 99.3FM n'ọnwa Ọgọst n'afọ 2018 mgbe ụlọ ọrụ a bidochara ọhụụ. N'ụlọ ọrụ a Sandra bụ onye nchịkọta ihe a kpọrọ 'Hard Facts' ana-ekwuputa nke a bido n;elekere atọ nke mgbede wee ruo elekere asaa nke abalị. Program a so bụ nke ise n'ime otu si agụpụta ndi kacha mee nke ọma." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Adaora Onyechere dika ọ di ugbu a na-achịkọta ihe ana-emepụta nakwa ekwupụta bụ nke a kpọrọ 'Talk2Adaora n'ụlọ ọrụ Kiss 99.9FM. Nke a bụ nke na-eleba anya n'ihe gbasara nsogbu na-adapụta n'etiti ndi obodo na ndi na-achị ha nakwa ụzọ aga-esi gbochie ha." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Sylvanus, onye bụ onye enyemaka pụrụ iche nye onye bụbu Gọvanọ nke Imo steeti, Rochas Okorocha na-ahụ maka Ọhaneze ka a tọọrọ na Disemba 15, 2012 na elekere 2.30pm dị ka ụlọ ọrụ mgbasa ozi Nigeria nwere aha ọma siri kwu. Otu akwụkwọ mgbasa ozi Vanguard mere ka a mara na ndị na-jide ya chọrọ oge mgbapụta - otu narị nde naira nke bụ (na ọnụego mgbanwe) na 2012 nke ruru $ 640,000 (Nde narị isii na iri puku anọ US dollar) ka ndị jidere ya chọrọ ka ha wee hapụ ya. Ndị ụlọ mgbasa ozi Naịjirịa kwuru a tọhapụrụ Sylvanus n'aka ndị o tọọrọ na December 21, 2012 na elekere 10:30 nke abalị." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Dị ka otu n'ime nnukwu ụmụ nwanyị Naijiria na-ese ihe, Chidinma Ekile rụrụ ọrụ na MTN Power of 10 Concert nke a haziri na Septemba 2011 na ego ya dị ka ọ dị n'oge ahụ bụ $ 2.8million." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Neat FM (Ghana) Neat FM bụ ụlọ ọrụ redio dị na Greater Accra Region nke ndị otu akpọrọ Despite Group of Companies na achịkwata. Ụlọ ọrụ a na -arụ na 100.9fm nakwa n'ikuku. Ụlọ ọrụ so n'otu n;ime ụlọ ọru nke ndi Despite Group of Companies nwe ma na ahazi . Ụlọ ọrụ a gbadoro ụkwụ na-ikpọ naanị egwu ndị Africa nakwa mba ndị ọzọ. Neat FM na -enye ma na-akọpụta okpukpe ziri ezi na nke pụrụ iche nye ndi na-ege ya ntị." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Paul malitere ịme ịhe egwurịegwu dika onye nzuzu na ịhe egwurịegwu redio a nakpọ Wetin Dey na Radio Continental 102.3FM, Lagos. A maara ya na ịhe egwurịegwu ahụ dị ka \"Tatafo\" ebe oji ịhe egwurịegwu na ekwu okwu gbasara ịhe na eme na obodo. O bukwa onye na aguputa ịhe emume na ịhe oyoyo TV Continental na Naija FM 102.7." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Owerri nwere ọdụ ụgbọ elu dị kilomita iri abụo na atọ 14 mi irí na anọ n'ebe ndịda ọwụwa anyanwụ nke obodo ahụ, na-akpọ ọdụ ụgbọ elu Imo, nke dị na okpúru ọchịchị ime obodo Obiangwu, Ngor Okpala. Ọdụ ụgbọ elu (Sam Mbakwe Airport) na-enye ọrụ ụgbọ elu na Abuja, Legọsị́, Port Harcourt, na Enugu. Ugbu a, ọ na-eje ozi dị ka onye ọzọ maka Port Harcourt. Sam Mbakwe (Imo) International Cargo Airport bụzi International Cargo Airports. Ụfọdụ okporo ụzọ ndị isi na-agafe obodo ahụ bụ okporo ụzọ Port Harcourt , okporo ụzọ Aba ., okporo ụzọ Onicha ha na okporo ụzọ Okigwe . Okporo ụzọ dị n'ime obodo ahụ gụnyere okporo ụzọ Douglas, okporo ụzọ Weatheral , okporo ụzọ Tetlow, yana okporo ụzọ Works . Ahịa enyemaka bụ isi ahịa dị na Owerri mgbe e bibichara Ekewu Uk Owere." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Iso Ụzọ Kraịst bụ okpukpe kachasị na Owerri. Ndị Katọlik na ndị Anglịkan nwere ndị na-eso ụzọ kachasị ukwuu ma Owerri bụ ebe obibi nke Assumpta Cathedral, oche nke Roman Catholic Archdiocese nke Owerri (Latin: Archidioecesis Overriensis) na oche nke Seminarị. Archdiocese na-ekpuchi mpaghara nke square kilomita puku abụọ, narị iteghete na iri iteghete na isii, narị isii na iri asaa, narị iteghete na iri asatọ na isii n'ime nde mmadụ dị otu mara ụma asaa nọ n'ógbè ahụ bụ ndị otu Chọọchị Katọlik. All Saints Cathedral, Egbu bụ Chọọchị Anglican nke mbụ na nke Kasị Ukwu na Owerri na ebe obibi nke mbụ Igbo sụgharịrị akwụkwọ nsọ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Asụsụ Ìgbò bụ asụsụ nke ana-asụ n'ala Igbò nile gbaa gburugburu. Ọ bụkwa nke ndị nwe ya ruru ihe dị ka mmadụ di ndè ịrị abuo n'isi. Ọtụtụ n'ime ndị a bụkwa ndị Igbo, ebe ndị ọzọ n'ime ha bụ ndị ọbịa n'ala Igbo. Abịa n'asụsụ Igbo, e nwere ọtụtụ ire dị iche-iche nke mere ka ọ na-ebute nghọta he n'ime asụsụ a. Nke a kpara kwara eji we họpụta ihe akpọrọ Ìgbò Ízugbé. Ìgbò Ízugbé bụkwa nchọpụta nke ejiri asaa n'anya were họpụta ire nke ndị Owere sitere na Ímo steeti, ire nke ndị Awka nke sitere na Anambara steeti nakwa ire nke ndị Umuahia nke sitere na Abịa steeti. Ọ bụkwa nke a bụ asụsụ Ìgbò etiti nke a akwa ede n'akwụkwọ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Asụsụ Igbo abụrụ wo nnọọ asụsụ mụbara n'ụwa niile nke bụzi na eji ya agbasa nta akụkọ ma nedekwa ya ede." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Abia n'ala Igbo, eji asụsụ Igbo agọ̀ ọjị ma nekpekwa ekpere na ọgbakọ ndị ọdụ n'ala. Nezia, asụsụ Igbo bụ nnọọ ezigbo asụsụ ọ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Íhe butere ọgụ ahu: Ufọdụ ndi ụmụ okọrọbia agha nke Naigeria (ọtụtụ n'ime ha bụ ndi Ìgbo) gbara mgba okpụrụ n'ebe isi ọchichi ndi isi ala anyi Naigeria nọ. Ha sitéré na mgba okpụrụ ahu wéré gbụo ụfọdụ ndi isi ala anyi (ụfọdụ n'ime ha bụ ndi Haụsa) nke ndi bekee nyefere ọchichi n'aka tụpụ ha hapụ obodo anyi. Ha wéé gbanwe ọchichi obodo anyi ma wéré onye isi agha ha méé ye onye isi ala Naigeria. Aha ya bụ Major Aguiyi Ironsi (Ìgbo)." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Jémanị (asụsụ jéman: Bundesrepublik Deutschland), nke ana-kpo kwa, Federal Republic of Germany bụ otu ala ndi ocha no n'obodo ukwu adi-kpo Obodo Békè. Isi ya bụ Berlin." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Enugwu ghọrọ isi Ochichi obodo Eastern Region ka Naijiria nwechara nnwere onwe na 1960; mgbanwe mgbanwe mpaghara na 1967, 1976 na 1991 mere ka Enugwu bụrụ isi obodo nke steeti Enugu ugbu a. Na iri ato Mee 1967 ka a kpọpụtara Enugwu isi obodo Republic of Biafra dị mkpụmkpụ; n'ihi na a mara Enugwu ka \"isi obodo Igbo .\" Ka ndị agha Naịjirịa nwụchiri Enugwu, e bufere isi obodo Biafra n'Umuahia ." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "E boro ya ebubo na ọ ga-akpata $ 20 ijeri na-efu site na ụlọọrụ Petroleum. Onye isi ochichi Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN), Sanusi, kwughachiri okwu a n'oge onu ogugu nke PBS na 2 December 2015. Sanusi kwenyere na a chụru ya n´ọrụ ya na Central Bank of Nigeria n'ihi na o mere ka ọha mara n' Ijeri Dollars Abụọ '$2 billion dollaras' furu na Nigerian National Petroleum Corporation (NNPC) n'okpuru. Alison Madueke kwuru na Sanusi boro ya ebubo a Ị ji megwara ya maka n´ ọ nyereghị ya aka nweta ọkwa dika onye isi ndi African Development Bank (AfDB) ma kpochapụ ebubo ya." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Na 28 August 2017, otu ụlọikpe gọọmenti etiti Naijiria ijeri naira asaa na ụfọ nke pụtara nde dollar iri abụọ n'otu ($ 21 million) site n'aka ụlọ ọrụ akụ na Alison-Madueke." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Anadu mepụtara ejije ya na ulo oru nooro onwe ya akporo Blondes Production. A gbara ihe nkiri ahụ n'ime ụbọchị 17, ya na Anadu na-arụ ọrụ dị ka onye nduzi, onye edemede, onye na-emepụta ihe, onye na-eduzi onye nlekọta, onye na-ede akwụkwọ, onye na-ede ego, na onye ọka iwu. Ihe ego a na-akwụ na fim ahụ bụ ego ezinụlọ, ezinụlọ Anadu na-enye pasent 70 nke ego ahụ, ebe onye ya na ya na-arụ ọrụ Arie Esiri na-enye ego 30% fọdụrụnụ. B maka Nwa (2013) bido na mba ụwa na BFI London Film Festival na 2013. E gosiputara ya na AFI Fest ebe o meriri onyinye onyinye AFI Fest 2013 na onyinye ego nke $ 5,000. Emere ihe nkiri nke South Africa na Durban na July 19, 2014." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Na Eprel 2, 2013, Asomugha na San Francisco 49ers, bịanyere aka na nkwekọrịta otu afọ nke ọ ga-enweta ụgwọ ọrụ nke nde $1.35 dollars ya na ohere iji nweta ihe ruru nde $1.65 dollars na nkwado. Na November 4, 2013, otu ahụ gbaghaara Asomugha, wee hapụ ya na nkwekọrịta ahụ." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Ndi Football Association (FA) boro Mikel ebubo omume ojoo mbọchị 22 November 2012. E nyere ya mmachibido egwuregwu atọ ya na ụtụ £60,000 ntaramahụhụ maka onye ọka ikpe Mark Clattenburg ọkpari ma gwakwuo ajo okwu mgbe Chelsea meriri Manchester United." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Tupu mbido Arise News, ụfọdụ ndị ọrụ na ndị na-ebubata ihe ahịa mere mkpesa gbasara Obaigbena na ọ naghị akwụ ụgwọ mgbe ọ kwesịrị. Obaigbena akwụchara ndị niile o ji ụgwọ. Ka afọ atọ gachara o bidoro akwụkwọ akụkọ Arise News, Obaigbena tinyere aka na nyocha nke ndị ụlọọrụ na-ahụ maka mpụ na akụnaụba Naịjirịa na Naịjirịa (EFCC) na-eme, nke na-enyocha ego e mefuru $2.1 ijeri. Usoro nyocha a metụtara ọrụ Obaigbena. Banyere oge a, ndị ọrụ nọ na mkpesa maka ụgwọ eji ha." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Na Jenụwarị 27, 2016, ndị mgbachibido omekome na-ahụ maka mpụ Nchekwa na Akụnụba nke gbasara ego (EFCC) kpochiri ala na ụlọ ya na ụzọ mkpị Jabi Airport dị na Abuja, bụ nke Azụbụike Ihejirika. Ọ bụ otu n'ime ọtụtụ ndị isi ndị ọchịagha nke metụtara igwu wayo $ 2.1 ijeri nke ngwa agha nke metụtara onye bụbu onye ndụmọdụ n'ihe gbasara nchekwa obodo, Sambo Dasuki ." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Nwokorie nwetara mmachi afọ abụọ na mma nke € 1,500, mgbe o nyesịrị nlezianya na adịghi mma na 23 Febụwari n'afọ 2013 na 5th Fazaa International Powerlifting Competition. Ihe nlele gosiputatara na o bụ Furosemide, mmachibido iwu ahụ pụtara na ọ nweghị ike i zọọ mpi n'etiti 19 Eprel 2013 na 18 Eprel 2015." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Dr SID nwetara ohere ya n'ihu igwe okwu, mgbe emere ya onye otu Da Trybe, ma nye ya ohere na egwu nke butere ngagharị iwe na Naịjirịa Hipụ-họpụ, \"OYA\" na 2002 n'akụkụ Sasha, 2-Shotz, Timi, DEL, na ndị Trybesmen (Eldee, Kb na Freestyle). N'ime afọ na-esote SID dere ndekọ egwu mbido ya \"Don't Stop\" ma nwee vidiyo ahụ na nke mbụ na MBI kachasị iri na izu asatọ,o jidere ọrụ egwu ya ka ọ were otu afọ iji gụchaa nzere mahadum ya." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Christopher Michael Barrio Jr. (Jenụwarị 2, 2001-Mach 8, 2007) bụ nwa nwoke onye America dị afọ 6 nke e dinara n'ike ma gbuo na Brunswick, Georgia, na Machị 15, 2007. Achọtara ozu ya na Machị 15, 2007, naanị kilomita ole na ole site na ebe ọ na -efu." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Nwanyị ọchụnta ego nke afọ 2009-Equisite Magazine/Eloy '09 Awards." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "2009: Punk Roc/Love Song (Horse Trade Theater Group) na Kraine Theatre (Septemba 30-October 3, 2009)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Ndị Kievan Bolshevik ndị gbapụrụ na Kharkiv sonyeere mpaghara Congress nke Soviets nke Donetsk-Krivoy Rog Soviet Republic. Ha kwuziri nzukọ a mbụ All-Ukrainian Congress of Soviets nke kwuputara okike nke Ukrainian People's Republic of Soviets. Ọ kpọrọ Central Rada nke Ukraine onye iro nke ndị mmadụ na-akpọsa agha megide ya na Jenụwarị 2. Rada mebiri njikọ niile ya na Petrograd na Jenụwarị 22, 1918 ma kwupụta nnwere onwe, si otú ahụ malite Agha Independence nke Ukraine.[2[2] 3] Ọ bụ n'oge a ka ndị agha Bolshevik malitere ịwakpo Ukraine site ] na Russia.[4] Ndị agha Russia si Kharkiv, Moscow, Minsk na ụgbọ mmiri Baltic wakporo Ukraine.[5]Ọnwa Iri na Abụọ 1917-Eprel 1918" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Bilikis Abiodun Otunla (amuru na ọnwa June 12, na afọ 1994) bu onye ebuli elu Naijiria . Ọ gbara asọmpi n'egwuregwu Afrịka nke afọ 2015 wee nweta ihe nrite ọla edo 69 nke ụmụnwaanyị&nbsp;Otu n'arọ - Ọ dị ọcha na jerk 1ST (Gold), Ụmụ nwanyị 69 – 75&nbsp;Otu n'arọ - Trekken 1ST (Gold) na ụmụ nwanyị 69 - 75&nbsp;kg - Total Gold O sonyekwara na 2016, 2018 na 2019 nke asọmpi egwuregwu Afrịka meriri ọla edo na ha niile ma e wezụga 2019 nke a kwụsịrị mgbe o meriri ya n'ihi ule mgbochi doping dara ada. ma e nyeghị ya ihe nrite ọla-edo ahụ. Na 2019 amachibidoro ya ruo 2027 site na International Weightlifting Federation mgbe ọ nwesịrị nnwale maka metenolone na metenolone metabolites." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Ụmụ nwanyị 69-75&nbsp;n'arọ - Ọ dị ọcha ma na-ama jijiji 1ST Ụmụ nwanyị 69 - 75&nbsp;kg – Trekken 1ST Ụmụ nwanyị 69 – 75&nbsp;n'arọ - ngụkọta ọla edo" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Enweghị nhọrọ ndị ọzọ, Anderson kụziri geography, ịgụ na mgbakọ na mwepụ na klas nke asaa na ụlọ akwụkwọ dị na Altheimer ruo ọnwa isii (n'agbanyeghị, site na ntinye onwe ya, \"Amaghị m ọbụna ihe gbasara ọdịdị ala karịa ụmụ akwụkwọ\" ). E nyeziri ya onyinye National Science Foundation nke Kimuel Alonzo Huggins, onye isi oche ngalaba kemịkalụ mahadum Atlanta, ka ọ mụọ maka nzere Master na kemịkalụ. Mgbe alụmdi na nwunye ya na Leonard Sinclair Anderson n'afọ 1960, ọ fọrọ nke nta ka ọ kwụsị na mmemme ahụ n'ihi ihe isi ike ego, n'agbanyeghị mkpakọrịta. Dr. Huggins tinyere aka ọzọ, ma nye ya ego nyocha ka ọ nwee ike ịga n'ihu na-agụ akwụkwọ na ụlọ nyocha ya. Ọ nabatara, n'agbanyeghị na isiokwu nyocha ya \"enweghị mmasị na ya.\" Anderson nwetara akara ugo mmụta Master ya na organic chemistry na Atlanta n'afọ 1961, na nyocha nke Dr. Huggins na-elekọta na usoro nhazi nke butadiene, nke akpọrọ: \"Studies on 1- (4-Methylphenyl) -1,3-Butadiene\"." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Chineke bụ aha ọzọ ndi Igbo n' omenala Igbo kpọrọ Chukwu. Mgbe ndị bekee bịara, ha mee ya nke ndi okpukpere ụka. N'echiche ndi okpukpere chi nke Omenala Ndi Igbo, Christianity, Judaism, ma Islam, Chineke nwere ọtụtụ utu aha, ma nwee nanị otu aha. Ụzọ abụọ e si akpọ aha ahụ bụ \"Jehovah maọbụ Yahweh\". N' ọtụtụ Akwụkwọ Nsọ, e wepụla aha Chineke ma jiri utu aha bụ \"Onyenwe Anyị\" maọbụ \"Chineke\" dochie ya. Ma mgbe e dere akwụkwọ nsọ, aha ahụ bụ Jehova pụtara n’ime ya, ihe dịka ugboro pụkụ asaa(7,000).",
        "Na Gusau, Oge ọkọchị na-acha uhie uhie ma na-ekpo ọkụ n'afọ niile, ebe oge mmiri na-emegbu ma na-acha ọkụ.",
        "Kanae Shirosawa(白沢かなえ Shirosawa Kanae, a mụrụ na July 18) bụ onye na-abụ abụ Japan na onye na-eme ihe nkiri na Japan.",
        "'Women and Ritual in Africa' in The Will to Arise: Women, Tradition, and the Church in Africa (1992)",
        "Na 17 Julaị 2017 Erigga wepụtara abọm ya A Trip to the South nke gụnyere Orezi, Skales, Duncan Mighty na ọtụtụ ndị ọzọ.",
        "N'afọ 2019, o bipụtara vidiyo “When your guy is a real gee”, ọ bụ nke zuruoha, wee gbasaa na netwọk mmekọrịta. Ọ ghọrọ vidiyo ya kacha ewu ewu nke nwere nlele 10,000 n'oge ahụ.",
        "Margaretha Murray (aha ogbo Milan Murray ) (30 Ọktoba 1974) bụ onye ome ihe nkiri na ode nkeSouth Africa.",
        "Nwachukwu họọrọ Aggies karịa Oklahoma, Missouri, Notre Dame, Nebraska, na Louisville. Ọ kara akara ozigbo na mbido ya dị ka eziionye ọhụrụ. Na 2009, o duuru ndị Aggies wideout na yaadị 708 na njide 40, wee bụrụ onye nke abụọ na njide touchdown na isii. O nwere egwuregwu nnabata yard 100-yard atọ n'afọ, nke kekọrọ ndekọ onye ọhụụ n'ụlọ akwụkwọ. Na 2010, Nwachukwu nọ na ndepụta preseason maka ihe nrite Biletnikoff . Ọ nọchara oge ya na A&M dị ka otu n'ime naanị Aggies anọ nwere ihe karịrị catches 120, yard 1,500, na touchdown 10 n'ọrụ ya. Na mkpokọta o nwere njide 152 maka yaad 2239 na mmetụ aka 19. O nwekwara ọnwụnwa ọsọ ọsọ 14 maka yad 131 na mmetụ aka 1.",
        "Ogundeyi bụ onye otu UBA site na 2004 ruo 2006. O mechara rụọ ọrụ maka ụlọ ọrụ gụnyere McKinsey &amp;amp; Company, ebe ọ rụrụ ọrụ na ndụmọdụ na Brussels na Johannesburg . Mgbe ya na McKinsey & Company gasịrị, ya na Ericsson rụkọrọ ọrụ dị ka onye isi njikwa ika maka Sub-Saharan Africa wee gaa na Google dị ka onye njikwa ụlọ ọrụ.",
        "2004: Ihe nrite onye isi ala n'oge mbụ maka ndị sayensị na ndị injinia",
        "40 mara mma na gafere: Bata na ike gị na nnabata mgbanwe (Ya na Margie Orford - 30 Septemba 2006). Spearhead P. .",
        "Site n'ọnwa Jenụwarị nke afọ 2005 ruo ọnwa Ọgọst nke afọ 2006, Fatima Waziri-Azi rụrụ ọrụ dị ka onye ọka iwu/onye isi mmemme na ikike ụmụnwanyị, okwu ntuli aka, na ngalaba ndozigharị nke ikpe ziri ezi. Site n'ọnwa Febrụwarị nke afọ 2016 ruo Nọvemba 2018, ọ rụrụ ọrụ dị ka onye nyocha na mmemme na Kọmitii Ndụmọdụ Onye isi ala megide nrụrụ aka nke a kpọrọ Presidential Advisory Committee Against Corruption (PACAC) n'asụsụ bekee. Site n'ọnwa Nọvemba 2018, ọ rụrụ ọrụ dị ka onye na-enye ndụmọdụ gbasara iwu n'ụlọ ọrụ osote onye isi oche nke Federal Republic of Nigeria. Na Septemba 2021, Fatima Waziri-Azi ka a họpụtara dịka onye isi oche nke National Agency for the Prohibition of Trafficking in Persons (NAPTIP).",
        "Onye otu obodo na Guilds nke London Institute (FCGI)",
        "Ụlọ ọrụ ahụ anaghị anakọta ma ọ bụ depụta ozi usoro banyere ndị ahịa na-abịa ma chọọ enyemaka, ndị ọrụ ya na-arụkwa ọrụ n'okpuru ọrụ nzuzo. Otú ọ dị, ndị ọrụ nke ụlọ ọrụ nkwado ahụ nwere ihe ọmụma kachasị ogologo na nke ọma banyere ọnọdụ ịgba akwụna na mmepe ya na mpaghara Helsinki, ahụmịhe a dịkwa maka ebumnuche nyocha n'èzí.",
        "Nyochaa maka mmebi iwu ụlọ ọrụ megide iziga email na-akpasu iwe ma ọ bụ nke na-akpali agụụ mmekọahụ.",
        "A mụrụ Owen Omogiafo na Mee 28, 1980 na Benin City, Edo State, Nigeria. Ọ gara mahadum Benin, ebe ọ nwetara nzere bachelọ (nsọpụrụ okpukpu abụọ) na Sociology na Anthropology. O nwetara nzere Master of Science na Human Resource Management site na London School of Economics and Political Science ma bụrụkwa nwata akwụkwọ nke Lagos Business School na IESE Business School, Spain.",
        "A nabatara ya na EMY Awards Africa, Ghana Edition. A họpụtara ya dị ka onye na-ese ihe na GUBA Awards 2019. O nwetara ihe nrite na ihe nrite ego site na MTN Heroes of Change 2019 mgbe ekpughere onye mmeri maka ihe omume ahụ.",
        "The Egyptian Arts Preservation Society na-asọpụrụ ya n'afọ 2015.",
        "PROFILE: Osita Chidoka, Corps Marshal na Chief Executive, Federal Road Safety Corps",
        "A mụrụ Michaela Ewuraba Boakye-Collinson na East London. Nne na nna ya bụ ndị Ghana. Ya na nwanne ya nwanyị tolitere na East London, ọkachasị Hackney na Tower Hamlets, ya na nne ha. Ọ gara ụlọ akwụkwọ Katọlik na East London, ma kwuo na, n'oge ụlọ akwụkwọ praịmarị, ọ na-emegbu ụmụ akwụkwọ ndị ọzọ, na-ekwu na ọ bụ n'ihi ịnọpụ iche ya dịka naanị nwa akwụkwọ ojii n'afọ ndụ ya. Nkewa ahụ anọgideghị na agụmakwụkwọ sekọndrị ya na ụlọ akwụkwọ zuru oke.",
        "Akwụkwọ mbụ ya ama ama n'ịntanetị bụ Sparkneedle na Lucas na Odessa, nke ọ malitere ịde na Girlamatic na 2003. Trotman wepụtara Templar, Arizona na 2005. N'afọ 2007, ọ tọrọ ntọala Iron Circus Comics, onye na-ebipụta ihe nkiri ndị ọzọ dị na Chicago nke bụ onye ọsụ ụzọ na ụlọ ọrụ ahụ maka iweta akwụkwọ ndị na-enweghị atụ, sci-fi, na erotica n'ahịa ma na-ebipụta ndị na-ese ihe na-enweghị nnọchi anya. Ọ gwara Chicago Tribune na ịba ụba dị iche iche na nnọchi anya na ihe nkiri bụ akụkụ nke mkpali ya ịmalite Iron Circus Comics: \"Mgbe m na-abanye n'ime ihe ọchị, ọ dịghị ohere ọ bụla maka ndị dị ka m - ndị na-acha ọcha chọrọ ịkọ akụkọ nke ha, ma ọ bụ ụmụ nwanyị chọrọ ịkọ akụkọ nke ha. Comics nwere echiche siri ike banyere ihe ga-ere ma ọ bụ ihe ruru eru dị ka niche. Ihe ọ bụla nwoke na-acha ọcha, nwoke na-edina nwoke ga-eme ga-akọwa na ọ bụrụ nke nwere mmasị zuru ụwa ọnụ, mana ihe ọ bụla m ga-eme ga-ahazi na-akpaghị aka dị ka ihe siri ike ijikọ ma ọ bụ niche.",
        "Chanell Stone bụ onye Amerịka na-ese foto. Ọ bụ onye ojii amara ya maka usoro \"Natura Negra\". Stone bi ma na-arụ ọrụ na Oakland, California.",
        "Peter Eastman (amụrụ n'afọ 1976) bụ Ónyé na-ese ihe nà South Africa bị nà Cape Town .",
        "O mekwara ihe nkiri n'afọ 2016 wepụtara \"REFUGEES\" nke e mere na Ghana n'afọ 2012 ma wuchaa na Atlanta USA n'ime ọnwa ndị ikpeazụ nke afọ 2013.",
        "1985 Nkwupụta 1986 Onye nkuzi nke ihe nkiri, School of Arts na Josephine Baker, Paris",
        "Reed nyèrè ákà na MIT Press's The Dance Review Winter 2020 mbipụta na edemede banyere Performance Art Is...",
        "Ọ hapụrụ n'ọnwa Ọktoba n'afọ 2016, n'ihi na ọ pụtaghị n'afọ 2015 na mgbe onye nkuzi Alain Casanova rutere, ọ hapụrụ Ligue 2 Lens.",
        "N'afọ 2009, e nyere Kipyego onyinye Honda Sports nke atọ n'usoro. Ọ bụ onye na-eme egwuregwu mbụ a na-asọpụrụ ugboro atọ na ihe nrite mba nke mmemme ahụ. Kipyego mechiri ọrụ kọleji ya na 2009 Division I Indoor Track & Field Championships. O nwetara aha nke itoolu ya site na mmeri nke mita 5000. Nke a jikọtara ya na Suzy Favor-Hamilton nke Wisconsin maka ọtụtụ asọmpi NCAA. O were Kipyego naanị afọ abụọ na ọkara iji mezuo ihe Favor-Hamilton mere na anọ. Na asọmpi kọleji ikpeazụ ya, mile, ụzọ atọ n'ụzọ iri nke abụọ kewara Kipyego site na onye mmeri Sarah Bowman nke Mahadum Tennessee.",
        "Garh Tany (ntụgharị: Ọnyá ọzọ) (2003) Label: Free Music Art Production",
        "Nne na nna Lilanga bụ ndị Makonde (otu agbụrụ bi na Mozambique nakwa Tanzania). Nna ya bụ onye ọrụ ugbo, onye na-arụ ọrụ n'ubi sisal, o nwekwara ụmụnne nwoke abụọ, ndị nwụrụ tupu ya. Lilanga gara ụlọ akwụkwọ praịmarị naanị afọ atọ. N'ọrụ nke afọ ndị ikpeazụ ya, nke a raara nye ndụ obodo, ọ laghachiri ọtụtụ ugboro na nnọchite anya ncheta ya nke oge obi ụtọ, mgbe ụmụ akwụkwọ ụlọ akwụkwọ natara diplọma ha. [dị ka on &#x5D;",
        "Anyị chọrọ mgbanwe: Black Radical Women, 1965-85, California African American Museum, October 13, 2017 - January 14, 2018",
        "N'ọnwa Nọvemba 2020, a màrà ọkwa na Wolfe-Goldsmith ga-ese ihe osise na-elekwasị ányà na ikpe ziri ezi nke ọha na eze na onye ọrụ ibe ya Joshua Mays. Kaiser Permanente na ABG Art Group nyere iwu ka e see ihe osise ahụ, ma gosipụta ya n'èzí ọfịs Kaiser na etiti ọbọdọ Oakland tupu a mee atụmatụ ịkwaga Liberation Park. Ọzọkwa n'etiti obodo Oakland, Wolfe-Goldsmith eseela ihe osise atọ nke ónyé na-ese ihe Stoney Creation na ihe nlereanya Yanni Brump.",
        "Ọrụ Grant gosipụtara akụkọ ifo na eserese na eserese. N'ịchịkọta ihe oyiyi sitere na isi mmalite dịgasị iche iche, site na ihe ọchị ruo akwụkwọ akụkọ ihe méré eme, ọ na-emepụta akụkọ ihe méré anya nke na-enyocha ọdịdị ọdịbendị, agbụrụ na ndọrọ ndọrọ ọchịchị. Site na mgbawa nke agba na collage na ihe ndị dị mfe nke na-ekwu màkà echiche dị iche iche, Grant na-enyocha n'ime ọrụ ya: \"...[T]echiche nke mgbasa ozi na-aga n'ihu ma ọ bụ ọgba aghara n'azụ uche anyị na ihe na-eme n'ihu anyị. \"",
        "Swain edeela egwu ndabere nke etinyela n'ọtụtụ ihe nkírí na mmemme telivishọn, ọkachasị usoro ihe nkiri FOX bụ Bob's Burgers nke e nyèrè Swain ihe nrite Emmy maka onyinye ya na ihe omume nke meriri na ngalaba mmemme animated pụtara ìhè na 69th Primetime Emmy Awards na 2017.",
        "A mụrụ Esteri na Kampala, Uganda, ọ bụkwa onye Teso. Ọ bụ nwa nke isii n'ime ụmụ asatọ na ezinụlọ ya ebiela na Uganda. Esteri gara St. Joseph's Girl's Secondary School na Uganda ma rụọ ọrụ na egwuregwu ụlọ akwụkwọ na ịgba egwu.",
        "Mgbe a na-akwadebe mmanya ahụ, a na-enyocha mash ahụ na-agba ụka site na nnukwu ígwè, iji wepụ ọka ndị a na-emepu. A maara ihe dị n'ala nke ite ahụ dị ka intshela. A na-agbakwunye intshela na biya a na-agbanye agbanye, iji nye ụtọ ọzọ.",
        "N'abalị iri abụọ n'ọnwa Ọgọstụ n'afọ 2021, ọ sonyeere ndị otu Turkey bụ Denizlispor.",
        "A na-eji mmanụ sunflower, nke a na-ewepụta na mkpụrụ, esi nri, dị ka mmanụ na-ebu ibu na iji mepụta margarine na biodiesel, ebe ọ dị ọnụ ala karịa mmanụ oliv. Ụdị dị iche iche nke sunflower dị na ihe dị iche iche dị na abụba acid; ụfọdụ ụdị \"high-oleic\" nwere ọkwa dị elu nke abụba monounsaturated na mmanụ ha karịa ọbụna mmanụ oliv. A na-ejikwa mmanụ ahụ mee ihe mgbe ụfọdụ na ncha. Mgbe Agha Ụwa Mbụ gasịrị, n'oge Agha Obodo Russia, ndị mmadụ nọ na Ukraine jiri mmanụ mkpụrụ sunflower mee ihe na oriọna dị ka ihe na-anọchi anya kerosene n'ihi ụkọ. A kọwawo ìhè sitere na oriọna dị otú ahụ dị ka \"ihe jọgburu onwe ya\" na \"ihe na-ese anwụrụ ọkụ\".",
        "N'ịbụ nke onye ọchụnta ego Dutch, Cornelis Vink, debanyere aha na Naịjirịa na afọ 1980, ọ malitere ọrụ na Machị nke otu afọ ahụ. Ụlọ ọrụ ahụ ghọrọ akụkụ nke Tropical General Investment (TGI) conglomerate nke nwere ọdịmma azụmahịa dị iche iche na nri, ahụike, ọrụ ugbo, injinia na ụlọ ọrụ ndị ọzọ. Ụlọ ọrụ ahụ malitere nkesa nke Capri sonne na 1982 nke mesịrị pụta dị ka otu n'ime akara ya. N'afọ 1990, ọ malitere ire mmiri CHI n'ahịa, nke a na-ere na mbụ na ite mana mgbe afọ ole na ole gachara, a na-etinye ya na Tetra Pak. N'afọ 1996, ụlọ ọrụ ahụ webatara mmiri oroma Chivita n'ahịa ma dị ka ihe ọṅụṅụ gara aga, a na-ere ya na mbụ na ite ruo n'afọ 1997 mgbe etinyere igwe nkwakọba akwụkwọ. Ụlọ ọrụ ahụ mechara wepụta ụtọ atọ ọhụrụ na Tetra Brik: pineapple, mango na apụl na 1999 ọ webatara ngwakọta oroma na pineapple.",
        "N'agbanyeghị uru ego sitere n'ịrụ ọrụ na mba ofesi, nkewa site na mmekọrịta ezinụlọ na ọdịbendị gosiri na ọ na-emebi ahụike nke ndị ọrụ Filipino na-akwaga mba ọzọ. Ọtụtụ ụmụ nwanyị Filipino na-arụ ọrụ na mba ofesi enweela nsogbu uche, na-akọ mgbaàmà nke ịda mbà n'obi site na enweghị ihe, owu ọmụma, na obi amamikpe.",
        "\"Nijiria enwetaghị mmeri ọzọ n'oge ahụ.... Ogologo ezughi ezu.... Ọ bụ nnukwu ihe dara ada, \"ka onye Ghana a ma ama na-ahụ maka akụ na ụba bụ Nii Moi Thompson kwuru. O jiri ntuli aka ya tụnyere nke Liberia n'afọ 2005, na-ekwu, \"Ọbụna Liberia, nke na-apụta n'agha, nwere ntuli aka a pụrụ ịtụkwasị obi karịa Nigeria\".",
        "N'Déma, obodo na mpaghara dị na Faranah nke Guinea",
        "Ụlọ ọrụ ike anyanwụ nke Ouarzazate (Noor 1), ụlọ ọrụ ike anyanwụ dị na Ouarzazazate, Morocco",
        "Akara ụgbọ mmiri bụ St. George's Cross na-acha ọbara ọbara na ọkọlọtọ ọcha, na ọkọlọlọtọ mba na canton.",
        "Asụsụ Khoi /ˈkweɪ/ bụ asụsụ kachasị n'ime ezinụlọ asụsụ ndị na-abụghị asụsụ Bantu nkè sitere ná Southern Africa. Á na-ewere há dị kà alaka nkè ezinụlọ asụsụ Khoisan, a makwaara ha dị kà Central Khoisan n'ọnọdụ ahụ. Ọ bụ ezie ná á jụrụ Khoisan ugbu a dị ka ezinụlọ, a na-ejigide aha ahụ dị ka okwu dị mfe.",
        "Omar Faiek Shennib, Onye isi nke Royal Diwans,Onye osote onye isi na ụlọ omebeiwu na Minista nchekwa n'okpuru Eze Idris Al Senussi e nyere otuto na akụkọ mere eme nke Adrian Pelt, UN commissioner for Libya (1949 to 1951) maka imepụta ọkọlọtọ mbụ nke Libya. [citation needed] Dị ka Pelt si kwuo: \"n'oge mkparịta ụka nke Libya National Constitutional Convention, a na-esepụta akwụkwọ nke ọkọlọtọ mba ahụ nke Omar Faiek Sehennib [onye nnọchiteanya a ma ama si Cyrenaica] nyere nzukọ ahụ. Ihe osise ahụ nwere agba atọ; ọbara ọbara, oji na akwụkwọ ndụ akwụkwọ ndụ, na Crescent na Star na-acha ọcha n'etiti etiti ojii. Maazị Shennib gwara ndị nnọchiteanya ahụ na atụmatụ a enwetala nkwado nke Eze Ukwu nke Cyrenaica, Eze Idris Al Senussi [nke mechara bụrụ Eze Libya]. Nzukọ ahụ mechara kwado atụmatụ ahụ. \" [afọ dị mkpa] [peeji",
        "Ọmụmụ 31 Julaị 1864 Ọnwụ 2 Disemba 1915 (afọ 51) Ili South End Cemetery Port Elizabeth, Nelson Mandela Bay Metropolitan Municipality, Eastern Cape, South Africa Memorial ID 140645835",
        "O tinyere aka n'ihe karịrị puku abụọ ikpe ebe a na-eleghara ikike nwanyị anya. Ikpe ndị ahụ gụnyere igbu ụmụ nwanyị ma ọ bụ di ha site n'aka ndị uwe ojii. Ụlọ akwụkwọ Naijiria ma ọ bụ ọbụna ndị isi ụlọ ọgwụ leghaara ikike ụmụ ha anya.",
        "Oluwatosin \"Tosin\" Otubajo (amụrụ na 16 Julaị 1984) bụ onye Naijirịa bụbu onye na-agba bọọlụ nke gbara dịka onye na-echebe ndị otu ụmụ nwanyị Naijiria.",
        "Ọ malitere ọrụ iwu ya na 1993 na Gani Fawehinmi's Chambers na Lagos State, ndịda ọdịda anyanwụ Nigeria. Gani Fawehinmi Lagos Steeti",
        "Ogbugbu Saro-Wiwa kpaliri egwu \"Rational\" nke otu egwu Canada bụ King Cobb Steelie. Eze Cobb Steelie",
        "N'afọ 1999, n'agbanyeghị nnyocha gọọmentị etiti Canada mere nke chọpụtara na otu ụzọ n'ụzọ atọ nke olulu mmiri ndị dị n'ime ime obodo Ontario nwere E. coli, gọọmentị Ontario wepụrụ ule maka E.coli site na mmemme nyocha mmiri ọṅụṅụ ma mechie mmemme ahụ n'afọ 2000. N'ọnwa Juun afọ 2000, e nwere oke ọrịa E. coli n'ọtụtụ obodo dị n'ime ime obodo Ontario, ebe ọ dịkarịa ala mmadụ asaa nwụrụ site na iri mmiri na Walkerton. Ụlọ ọrụ nyocha onwe onye, A&L Laboratories, chọpụtara E. coli na mmiri mana ha ekpughere mmetọ ahụ na ndị ọchịchị mpaghara n'ihi oghere dị na iwu \"echiche nkịtị\". A&L Laboratories kwuru na nsonaazụ ule ahụ bụ \"ihe onwunwe nzuzo\" ya mere ọ bụ naanị \"onye ahịa\", onye bụ ndị isi Walkerton na-enweghị ọzụzụ maka nyocha kwesịrị ekwesị. Lee Escherichia coli.",
        "MV Iron Baron (nke bụbu MV Ocean Express na MV Irrawaddy) bụ ụgbọ mmiri 37,557 dwt nke e wuru na 1985. Ọ bụ BHP Shipping kwụrụ ya ụgwọ na 1990.",
        "Adam ghọrọ onye nkuzi na nkà ihe ọmụma na Mahadum áhà ya bụ Fort Hare na afọ 1959, n'afọ 1960 ọ bụ otu n'ime ndị guzobere Mahadum Western Cape (UWC) mgbe a họpụtara ya dị ka Onye isi nke Ngalaba Nkà ihe ọmụma. Na mbido afọ 1970 ọ sonyeere Black Consciousness Movement.",
        "Ihu igwe ahụ dị okpomọkụ : mana e nwere ike ị gụnyere ya na di ka nke akpọrọ okpomọkụ monsoon ihu igwe, e nwekwara ike ịgụ nyere ya okpomọkụ na agagharị agagharị na oge mmiri, okpomọkụ, oké ọhịa, ihu igwe, na savanna ihu igwe.",
        "N'ebe ugwu Sahel, osisi ogwu na osisi acacia na-eto n'ọhịa, ebe a na-azụ nkwụ, ọka, na ihe ọkụkụ ubi n'ọzara ndị dịgasị iche iche. N'èzí ebe obibi ndị a, ndị na-akwagharị akwagharị na-elekọta ìgwè atụrụ ha n'oge mmiri ozuzo, na-aga n'ebe ndịda ka nri na mmiri dị n'elu na-apụ n'anya na mmalite nke akụkụ ọkọchị nke afọ. Central Sahel nwere ahịhịa na-eguzogide ụkọ mmiri ozuzo na obere osisi. Mmiri ozuzo na-enwekwu n'ebe ahụ karịa na mpaghara Sahara. Dịka ọmụmaatụ, N'Djamena na-edekọ mmiri ozuzo kachasị elu kwa afọ nke 580 milimita (22.8 in), ebe Ouaddaï Prefecture na-enweta obere ihe.",
        "Usoro ókèala mbara ala na-atọ ntọala maka mgbanwe mgbanwe maka ọchịchị na njikwa, pụọ na nyocha nke ngalaba nke njedebe na uto nke ezubere iji belata mpụ na-adịghị mma, n'echiche nke ohere nchekwa maka mmepe mmadụ. Ókèala mbara ala na-ekpebi, dị ka a pụrụ isi kwuo ya, “ọgbọ egwuregwu mbara ala” maka ihe a kpọrọ mmadụ ma ọ bụrụ na a ga-ezere nnukwu mgbanwe gburugburu ebe obibi nke mmadụ na-ebute n'ọ̀tụ̀tụ̀ zuru ụwa ọnụ.",
        "A na-achọ ka aṅụ na ya na ihe ọkụkụ na 15 na 30% nke mmepụta nri US; ọtụtụ ndị ọrụ ugbo buru ibu na'èzí a na a mụrụ a iji nye ọrụ a. Nnyocha e mere n'afọ 2005 kọrọ na mpaghara ọrụ ugbo nke California, a chọpụtara na aṅụ ọhịa naanị nwere ike inye ọrụ mmịpụta ntụ ọka ma ọ bụ zuru ezu maọbụ melite ọrụ ndị a na-enye site na mmekọrịta omume. Otú ọ dị, usoro ọrụ ugbo siri ike nwere ike imebi ọrụ mmịpụta mkpụrụ osisi ngwa ngwa site na ọnwụ nke ụdị. Ụdị ndị fọdụrụnụ enweghị ike ịkwụ ụgwọ nke a. Nsonaazụ nke nnyocha a na-egosikwa na ọnụ ọgụgụ nke chaparral na osisi oak ebe obibi maka aṅụ ọhịa n'ime 1 02 kilomita nke ugbo nwere ike ime ka ọ kwụsie ike ma melite ọrụ pollination. Ọnụnọ nke ihe ndị dị otú ahụ na gburugburu ebe obibi na-arụ ọrụ dịka iwu mkpuchi maka ndị ọrụ ugbo.",
        "Ọ na-atụ anya, na-emepe emepe, na-egwupụta ma na-ere diamond site na nkwụnye ego mbụ na nke abụọ, nke a chọpụtara na mpaghara Cuango River, na mpaghara ugwu ọwụwa anyanwụ nke Angola nke na-emepụta ezigbo nkume. Nlere oke nke gravel teres nke osimiri dị na gburugburu osimiri Ganzo, Tázua na Ginge egosila akararịọla diamond akụ na ụba.",
        "Na June 2003, Jonah ghọrọ onye Ghana mbụ e mere knight na narị afọ nke 21 mgbe Prince of Wales nyere ya knighthood nsọpụrụ (KBE), iji kwado ihe ọ rụzuru dị ka onye ọchụnta ego Afrịka, onye isi azụmaahịa si Commonwealth, na onye isi ala. Jona edepụtara n'etiti ndị kasị baa ọgaranya na Ghana. N'ụbọchị nke ise n'ọnwa Disemba n'afọ 2019, ndị otu ndị ọrụ na-egwupụta akụ̀ na ụba na Ghana nwere ekele maka onyinye platinum maka enyemaka ya n'ịzụlite ụlọ ọrụ na-egwu akụ̀ n'ime ala na Ghana. Na Jenụwarị 2023, edepụtara ya n'etiti ndị Afrịka 100 a ma ama n'ọhịa azụmahịa.",
        "Luke (Hadžići), obodo dị na Sarajevo Canton, Bosnia na Herzegovina",
        "Kọmitii Senate maka nyocha nke onyeisi oche EFCC.",
        "Màkà nke dị ka ndị na ụdị nke oke ụra ehihie (SWAI-EDS), akara ngosi ngwa n'ihi na ụdị nke 40 ma ọ bụ n'okpuru na-egosi oke ụra, akara nke dị n'etiti 40 na 50 na-egosi na enwere ike ihi ụra na akara nke karịrị 50 bụ ihe dị mma.",
        "\"Orb\" hụrụ na United States site na nde mmadụ 0.28 na-ekiri ya. Oliver Sava nke The A.V. Club nyochara ihe omume a, na-enye ya B+. Ọ na-ekwu na ihe omume ahụ bụ \"ihe niile gbasara mgbanwe\".",
        "Coping Strategies Index (CSI) - na-enyocha omume ezinụlọ ma n'atụle ha dabere na omume dịgasị iche iche e guzobere na otu ezinụlọ si emeso ụkọ nri. Usoro maka nyocha a dabere na ịnakọta data na otu ajụjụ: \"Gịnị ka ị n'eme mgbe ị n'enweghị nri zuru ezu, ma enweghị ego zuru ezu ịzụta nri?\"",
        "Ka e guzobere Klọb Nde Iri, Netherlands nwere ihe karịrị nde mmadụ iri na ise. Klọb ahụ rụrụ ụka maka ọnụ ọgụgụ a chọrọ nke nde mmadụ iri kama, dịka ọnọdụ dị na 1950. Otú ọ dị, nyocha nke akara gburugburu ebe obibi nke ndị Dutch kpughere na ọnụ ọgụgụ a ka dị oke elu, n'ihi ihe ndị mmadụ na-eri na mmetọ. Dabere na ngụkọta nke Global Footprint Network na nso nso a, ndị Dutch na-eji okpukpu 6.2 karịa hekta zuru ụwa ọnụ karịa ka mba ha na-enye. Site na ọnụ ọgụgụ mmadụ karịrị nde mmadụ iri na asaa, nke a ga-abụ ọnụ ọgụgụ mmadụ na-adịgide adịgide nke naanị nde mmadụ abụọ na nde abụọ. Akụkụ dị ukwuu nke mkpochapụ a sitere na carbon footprint nke ndị Dutch. Mgbanwe ngwa ngwa gaa na ike na-agbanwe agbanwe yana mbelata dị ukwuu nke ojiji nwere ike ime ka ọnụ ọgụgụ dị elu nke ndị bi na ya nwee ike, na-enweghị mkpa ịdabere ma ọ bụ ọbụna iji mba ndị ọzọ mee ihe.",
        "soro odeakwụkwọ rụkọọ ọrụ iji mezuo ebumnuche nke Nkwekọrịta ahụ ma, ebe o kwesịrị, soro odeakwụkwọ na kọmitii rụkọọ ihe n'ịmepụta ụkpụrụ mba ụwa.",
        "N'akwụkwọ ya At the Hand of Man: Peril and Hope for Africa's Wildlife Raymond Bonner katọrọ WWF maka ebubo usoro neocolonialist. Na ntụle ya nke akwụkwọ ya, Ann O'Hanlon nke ọnwa Washington, onye kpọrọ ebubo Bonner \"nkwupụta zuru oke nke WWF\", dere, sị: \"Ndepụta nzuzo nke ndị otu na-agụnye pasenti na-enweghị isi nke ndị South Africa, ha niile nwere obi ụtọ n'oge. Ndị ọzọ nyere aka gụnyere ndị ọchụnta ego nwere njikọ echere, gụnyere mpụ ahaziri ahazi, mmepe mbibi gburugburu ebe obibi, na ndọrọ ndọrọ ọchịchị Africa rụrụ arụ. Ọbụna akụkọ dị n'ime ụlọ akpọrọ WWF's approach egocentric and neocolonialist. elu.)\"",
        "Corps Guestphalia na Suevoborussia Marburgge., \"befreundetes Verhältnis\" (2010/1978)",
        "Sierra Club hibere kọmitii ndọrọ ndọrọ ọchịchị wee mee nkwado onye isi ala mbụ ya na 1984 iji kwado mkpọsa Walter Mondale na-enweghi nke ọma iji wetuo Ronald Reagan. McCloskey gbara arụkwaghịm dị ka onye isi nchịkwa na 1985 mgbe 16+1⁄2 afọ (otu oge ahụ Brower duziri nzukọ a), wee weghara aha onye isi oche, wee bụrụ onye isi atụmatụ ụlọ ọgbakọ, na-etinye oge ya na amụma nchekwa karịa ịhazi atụmatụ mmefu ego. na nchịkwa. Mgbe ya na Douglas Wheeler nwechara mkparịta ụka afọ abụọ, onye nzere Republican ya na-agbakasị ndị otu na-emesapụ aka, ụlọ ọrụ ahụ goro Michael Fischer, onye bụbu onye isi California Coastal Commission, onye jere ozi dị ka onye isi nchịkwa site na 1987 ruo 1992. Carl Pope, bụbu onye otu klọb ahụ. Onye isi omebe iwu, a họpụtara onye isi nchịkwa na 1992.",
        "Obodo nke obodo: Betting, Gongelfang, Henting (German: Bettingen, Gongelfangen, Hintingerhof).",
        "A họpụtara Clooney dị ka onye kachasị mma nke Barbara Walters na 2014. Na 2014 British Fashion Awards, e depụtara ya maka Best British Style n' akụkụ David Beckham, Kate Moss, Keira Knightley n' Emma Watson.",
        ". Ntinda dị na Nakawa Division, otu n'ime ngalaba ụmụaka ise nke Kampala. Ókè ya bụ Kyambogo n'iyipada, Nakawa n'ebe ndịda, Naguru n'ebe mmalite, Bukoto n'ebe ugwu egwuregwu, Kigoowa n'ebe ugwu, na Kiwatule n'ebe ugwu ihie. Ebe a dị ihe dị ka 7 kilometers (4 mi), n'okporo ụzọ, northeast of Kampala's central business district. [1] Nhazi nke Ntinda bụ 0°21'18.0\"N, 32°36'52.0\"E (Latitude:0.355004; Longitude:32.614437)",
        "ACM bụ òtù jikọtara ọnụ nke nwere alaka steeti na mpaghara asatọ dị iche iche nke mejupụtara National College. [citation needed] Ọfịs mba ahụ dị na Canberra, Australia.",
        "Anthony Ujah (amuru 14 Ọktoba 1990) bu onye okachamara n'egwuregwu bọọlụ Naijiria nke na-egwu egwu n'ihu maka ọgbakọ German Eintracht Braunschweig na otu mba Nigeria.",
        ". Tolulope Odebiyi ( operason 14 Novemba 1963) bụ onye ọkụ ọkụ Naijiria si Ogun steeti, [1] bụ onye mgbaàmà na oche senatorial Ogun West na 2019. [2] [3] Ọ ọrụ dịka onye isi ọrụ Gọvanọ Ibikunle Amosun nke Ogun steeti.",
        ". Ogechie nkọwa nzere kla mbụ na injinia injinia na Mahadum Manchester yana MBA site na ụlọ akwụkwọ azụmahịa Manchester . [1] Emere akara ugo nhọrọ doctoral na ịzụ ahịa na Brunel Business School na United Kingdom.",
        "A manyere ya ịpụ n'ọkwa mgbe nnupụisi nke mere ka General Muhammadu Buhari nwee ike. Muhammadu Buhari \"Nigerian States\". WorldStatesmen . Retrieved 2010-03-25 .",
        "Ndị omeiwu zaghachiri site n'ịkwụsị ya izu abụọ.",
        "Nyere Kọmishọna Kasị Elu aka ịnọgide na-enwe mmekọrịta ya na gọọmentị, ụlọ ọrụ na ụlọ ọrụ United Nations ndị ọzọ, otu mba ụwa, ụlọ ọrụ mpaghara na mba, ndị na-abụghị gọọmentị, ngalaba nkeonwe na agụmakwụkwọ.",
        "Ajụjụ ọnụ Judy Malloy, Social Media Archaeology and Poetics, na-aga n'ihu na mgbakwunye na MIT Press Book Networked Art Works: na Formative Years of the Internet, 2019.",
        "The Outlaws (Oxford American, Summer, 2013)",
        "Onyinye nke Merit na Nraranye na ọrụ, site na St. Lawrence Church Women, Mbaukwu, Anambra state (2016)",
        "Enweghị àgwà: Omume na Omume Omume (Cambridge, 2002)",
        "Nwankwo malitere ọrụ ụlọ akụ ya na 1951 na-arụ ọrụ dị ka odeakwụkwọ na alaka Port Harcourt nke Bank of British West Africa . Ọ nọrọ afọ itoolu n'ụlọ akụ ahụ tupu ọ gbaa arụkwaghịm.",
        "Greenwood nwere obere mkpakọrịta nyocha St Catharine's College, Cambridge, site na 2000 ruo 2002. bụ onye nkuzi na Grik na Mahadum St Andrews site na 2002 ruo 2008, wee sonye na Ngalaba Classics na Yale na 2009, ebe ọ bụ Prọfesọ nke Classics. họpụtara ya dị ka John M. Musser Prọfesọ nke Classics n'ọnwa Ọktoba 2020. [1]",
        "Adebayo Bolaji, onye Naijiria na-ese ihe, onye na-eme ihe nkiri, onye edemede na onye nduzi",
        "Abụ ịhụnanya maka Amman (nke mbụ: Qaṣāʼid ḥubb fī ʻAmmān), Akwụkwọ Obodo Ukwu Amman, Ụlọ nke Abụ Jọdan, 2006.",
        "Ihe osise \"The Unicorn is Found\" pụtara n'otu n'ime ihe nkiri ikpeazụ na ihe nkiri Ghosts of Girlfriends Past.",
        "- Joachim Dalencé tụrụ aro iwu thermometer site na ịkewa n'ime ogo 20 hà nhata oge dị n'etiti mmiri oyi na bọta na-agbaze, mgbe ahụ na-agbakwunye ogo 4 n'elu na ala.",
        "Anna Maria Truter, Lady Barrow (17 August 1777 - 15 December 1857) bụ onye na-ese ihe omume na Cape Colony. Ka ọ na-erule oge ọ rọ Cape na 1803, ọ chị achị akwụkwọ a mara nke ọkụ, osisi na mbụ ala Cape. Di ya, Sir John Barrow, 1st Baronet, ekiri Ode akwụkwọ nke ihe nke Admiralty na 1804, ma dee An Account of Travels into the Interior of Southern Africa, in the Years 1797 and 1798 (London, 1801).",
        "N'afọ 2012, Woodall meriri ntuli aka ahụ na 62.16% nke vootu 252,066, megide Steve Reilly (D).",
        "Ememme ihe nkiri Torino, Italy (Nọvemba 24, 2020)",
        "\"Face to Face\" (abụ Barry Gibb na Olivia Newton-John) , 1984",
        "A na-ewere ụdaume ɨ (n'asụsụ Võro nke e dere na õ ma Ọ bụ y, lee ngalaba Orthography) dị ka ụdaume azụ maka ebumnuche nkwekọrịta, mana ọ naghị etinye aka na nkwekọrịta n'onwe ya, ebe ọ na-adịghị eme na nsonaazụ na njedebe.",
        "Mpomam (obodo ukwu nke Lomié na Ngoila, ngalaba nke Haut-Nyong, Eastern Region)",
        "Film Bulletin kwuru \"Nke a bụ ihe ọchị na-enweghị ọchị na-eme obere ihe banyere ọnọdụ ya. Ihe ọchị ndị ahụ bụ n'ụzọ dị ukwuu banyere Robertson Hare na-eyi uwe elu ahịhịa ma na-ele Sadie na-asa ahụ n'oké osimiri. \"",
        "N'ịgbaso ihe ngosi ngosi ahọpụtara na Jenụwarị 22, ewepụtara ihe nkiri ahụ na ụlọ ihe nkiri 81 na United States na Jenụwaị 24, 2020. Site previews na ụlọ ọrụ ịkụ nzọ mbụ na ngwụsị izu, ihe nkiri ahụ nwetara $ 358,154 n'ime ụbọchị anọ ahụ.",
        "Carlos Paulo Simões (amụrụ na 11 June 1951), bụ onye Angola na-eme ihe nkiri na onye edemede. maara ya nke ọma maka ọrụ ya na ihe nkiri Operation Autumn, The Consul of Bordeaux na Cacau da Ribeira . [1]",
        "Oji na Ọcha na agba (French: La Victoire en chantant, wee Noirs et Blancs en couleur maka mbipụta 1977) bụ ihe nkiri agha French-Ivorian 1976 na ihe ọchị ojii nke Jean-Jacques Annaud duziri na mpụta mbụ ya. Edere ihe nkiri a na ihe nkiri Africa nke Agha Ụwa Mbụ, n'oge mwakpo ndị France wakporo ógbè Germany nke Kamerun. Ihe nkiri a na-anabata echiche mgbochi mgbochi siri ike, ma bụrụkwa ihe kwesịrị ịrịba ama maka ịkwa emo ndị France emo ọbụna karịa ndị ogbo ha German.",
        "A mụrụ Skefu na 14 Eprel 1964 na Botswana wee kwaga na Soweto, Gauteng. O mechara tolite na Bloemfontein ya na nne na nna ya ochie na Lesotho. Ọ gụsịrị akwụkwọ na diploma dị elu na Beauty Therapy na Mahadum St. Thomas na Texas, Houston.",
        "A mụrụ ya na Yaba, Lagos. Ọ si Kabba LGA na Kogi Steeti. 'ime ụmụ anọ, ọ bụ naanị nwa nwanyị na nke atọ n'usoro ọmụmụ. Ariyike gụsịrị akwụkwọ sekọndrị na Starfield College wee nweta nzere Bachelor of Arts na nzikọrịta ozi na Lagos State University . [1] Ọ nwetakwara asambodo na Mgbasa ozi site na National Broadcast Academy, Lagos.",
        "Ndị mụrụ ya gbahapụrụ ya n'amaghị ha, di na nwunye na-azụ ahịa obere Acheapong nabatara ya mgbe ọ dị naanị otu ọnwa. Nna ya nwụnahụrụ ya mgbe ọ ka dị obere, ihe sikwara ike. Ọ bụ nne kuchiri ya zụrụ ya n’oge ọ na-agụ akwụkwọ. Agbanyeghị, ọ kwụsịrị ịga ụlọ akwụkwọ sekọndrị n'ihi na nne ya enweghịkwa ego ọ ga-eji nweta ego ọ na-edobere. O kpebiri itinye uche n'ịgba bọl iji nweta ego iji lekọta onwe ya ma kwado nne ya n'ụzọ ego.",
        "\"Ndị na-acha uhie uhie na Louisiana\", 1917, na Journal of Negro History.",
        "Ụmụaka ndị a gbahapụrụ kpam kpam enweghị njikọ ezinụlọ ma nọrọ naanị onwe ha maka nlanarị anụ ahụ na nke mmụọ. Ha bụ ihe dịka 5%–10% nke ụmụaka nọ n'okporo ámá na Philippines.",
        "E liri ya na Arlington National Cemetery ya na nri ya, Anna Kelton Wiley (1877–1964), onye ọ na-ebi na 1911. Edekwara ili ya \"Nna nke Iwu nri dị ọcha\".",
        "A na-eme njem site na 5km ruo 45km n'ebe dị anya n'ọtụtụ ebe gburugburu Australia (ihe karịrị 60 na 2005, na gburugburu 100 na 2006) . Ọtụtụ ụlọ akwụkwọ na otu obodo na-ahazi mmemme nke ha kwa afọ, ma ọ bụ sonye na mmemme buru ibu na obodo ma ọ bụ mpaghara mpaghara.",
        "Pacho Rueda dị ka Pedro “El Potro” Rentería",
        "Mnamo Januari 2012, Tume ya Mawasiliano ya Shirikisho ilitoa vibali vya ujenzi vya Jumuiya ya Wahindi ya Gila River kwa ajili ya vituo kadhaa vya televisheni kuwa ndani na kuidhinishwa kuhudumia kabila hilo. Hizi ni pamoja na K19JT-D na K28MO-D. Hata hivyo, ilikuwa zaidi ya miaka saba hadi kazi ilipoanza tena katika kampuni; kwa upande wa K28MO-D, gazeti la Gila River lazima lionyeshe kuwa KCOS-LP, kituo cha muda mrefu cha analogi kwenye chaneli 28 ambayo leseni yake bado iko kwenye vitabu, inafanya kazi.",
        "Ime ụlọ ahụike uche 3 (Nlekọta nke South London &amp;amp; Maudsley NHS Foundation Trust na-enye) yana ọnụ ụlọ ajụjụ ọnụ.",
        "Ndị International Fund for Agricultural Development (IFAD) depụtara agbụrụ Yaifo n'etiti agbụrụ na agbụrụ Simbu na East Sepik. A na-eleta ebo a ugboro ugboro ma so na ndị kacha dịrị anya na Papua New Guinea. Ha bụ otu n'ime ebo ole na ole nke ndị nọ n'ụwa na-adịghị anọgide na-enwe mmekọrịta ha na ndị ọzọ. Edepụtara obodo Yaipo dị na East Sepik Province dị ka ị na-asụ olumba nke asụsụ Nete, nke na-eme ka mgbanaka n'etiti ụdaume na-atụ aro ịkpọ /jaiɸo/.",
        "Dị ka ọtụtụ obodo Central Anatolian ndị ọzọ, ọrụ bụ isi bụ ọrụ ugbo . Ihe ọkụkụ a na-akpọkarị bụ ọka wit. Ịzụ anụmanụ bụ ọrụ akụ na ụba ọzọ. N’ezie, aha obodo ahụ bụ akpa akpụkpọ e ji emepụta cheese. Malite na 1970s, ọtụtụ ndị bi na Kılbasan kwagara West Europe (karịsịa Netherlands ) ịrụ ọrụ dị ka ndị ọrụ mmepụta ihe ( Gastarbeider ). Ya mere ọnụ ọgụgụ ndị de jure nke obodo ahụ karịrị ọnụ ọgụgụ a kpọtụrụ aha n'elu.",
        "Rich Hill bụ ihe nkiri akwụkwọ nke America 2014 nke Andrew Droz Palermo na Tracy Droz Tragos na-eduzi ma duzie ya gbasara Rich Hill, Missouri . [1] Emere ihe nkiri a na 2014 Sundance Film Festival, [2] ebe o meri US Grand Jury Prize maka akwụkwọ akwụkwọ",
        "Ụlọ Florence bụ ụlọ 3 akụkọ na Portland, Maine, United States, aha ya bụ Florence Young \"onye na-elekọta mmadụ nke ji ihe karịrị afọ 20 na-arụ ọrụ na Preble Street.\"",
        "E wuru ụlọ oriri na mmanya na 1908 dị ka Golden West Hotel, maka 1915 Panama–Pacific International Exposition . [1] N'oge oge mmachibido iwu, 10,000 square feet (930 m speakeasy a na-akpọ The Golden Bubble dị n'okpuru ụlọ nkwari akụ ahụ. [2] [3] Ala terrazzo mbụ na akwụkwọ ahụaja ka dị n'ebe. a na-eji ugbu a dị ka ebe nchekwa.",
        "Mgbe ọ nọ n'ụlọ akwụkwọ sekọndrị El Camino, ọ mụtara nkuzi ime ihe. Ọ banyere na Mahadum Southern California (USC) na akwụkwọ mmụta onye isi ala, na-eme ihe nkiri okpukpu abụọ na ihe nkiri na mmekọrịta mba ụwa. Ọ kwụsịrị ilekwasị anya na ọrụ ime ihe nkiri, mana ọ gụchara nzere bachelọ na Mee 2013.",
        "E gosipụtara ọrụ ya n'ọtụtụ ebe, gụnyere na Venice Biennale (2001) na MOMA (2006), ma dịkwa na nchịkọta nke Ebe nkiri mba nke nka Afrịka, Washington D.C.",
        "2011 Ụlọikpe Mpụ, Mario Mauroner Contemporary Art, Vienna",
        "Charlot Magayi (amụrụ c. 1993) bụ onye na-emepụta stovu Kenya, onye na-akwado ihu igwe na onye meriri ihe nrite Earthshot na 2022. Enyere ya na ụlọ ọrụ ya Mukuru Stoves otu nde pound iji kwalite echiche ha na emume na Boston, Massachusetts.",
        "Ikpe Edmonds na ihe ngosi 2015 Anyị Na-ekwu: Black Artists na Philadelphia, 1920s-1970s na Woodmere Art Museum . [1] Ụbọchị ya bụ na nchịkọta nke Pennsylvania Academy of the Fine Arts . [2] Akwụkwọ dị na Smithsonian Libraries and Archives .",
        "N'afọ 2017, ọ sonyeere ngalaba na Leiden_University\" id=\"mwLw\" rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" title=\"Leiden University\">Mahadum Leiden dị na Leiden, Netherlands . N'afọ 2019, ọ bụ onye ndụmọdụ na French Ministry of Europe and Foreign Affairs na French Ministry for Defense gbasara iwughachi Iraq.",
        "A mụrụ ya na June 14, 1987, Gilbert tolitere na Koforidua wee gaa ụlọ akwụkwọ sekọndrị St. Peter's Boys Senior High School dị na Nkwatia maka agụmakwụkwọ sekọndrị. E mechara nye ya nzere na Telecommunication Engineering site na mahadum Ghana Communications Technology University .",
        "The Sun-Herald (Sydney) - \"Rich Kitsch\" 26 March 2006 (Home on Sunday, pg. 8)",
        "Judith McWillie na Grey Gundaker. Enweghị Oghere Ezochiri: Mmụọ nke African American Yardwork (Knoxville: Mahadum Tennessee Press, 2005) pp.&nbsp;39, 40, 168–171.",
        "Na Nọvemba 2017, akwụkwọ akụkọ Forbes họpụtara Stingily maka '30 Under 30' ama ama na ngalaba Arts na Culture.",
        "Mpempe akwụkwọ a sitere na Ogige nke Benin ma mepụta ya n'etiti narị afọ nke 16 na 19. Ndị agha Britain weghaara ya na 1897 mgbe ha nọ na njem ntaramahụhụ wee were ọtụtụ puku iberibe nka n'alaeze Benin. Ọ bụ na ọrịre JC Steven na 1900, tupu James T. Hooper enweta ya gburugburu 1945 na Oxford, UK. Achọpụtara na ọ dị n'ụlọ ịre ahịa Christie's Britain na 1976. Mgbe ahụ ọ kwụsịrị n'aka Mazị na Oriakụ Klaus G. Perls nke New York na 1981. Ha nyere ya ihe ngosi nka nke Metropolitan na 1991.",
        "1973: Susan Loppert Graphics, London. Central London Polytechnic. John Hansard Gallery, Mahadum Southampton | England.",
        "Jaret Vadera ( malite 1976) bụ onye omenkà Canada na-arụ ọrụ n'etiti New York, Toronto, na India. [1] Vadera na-arụ ọrụ n'ofe mgbasa ozi, nke elele na ohere ebe, foto, vidiyo vidiyo, na mgbasa ozi ọhụrụ na-agafe..",
        "Michi Himeno (姫野 美智, Himeno Michi) bụ onye Japan na-ese ihe nkiri na onye nrụpụta agwa. Ọrụ ya kachasị ama bụ na usoro ihe nkiri TV The Rose of Versailles na Saint Seiya.",
        "Ọ lụrụ mgbe ọ dị afọ 19 na Greg Tindel, onye ọka iwu. [1] Ọ maliteghị ịmepụta ihe osise nke ya ruo 1990, mgbe ọ dị afọ 26, mgbe ọ dị ime nwa nke abụọ ya. [2] [3] Ná mmalite ọrụ ya dị ka onye na-ese ihe, Tindel nwunye ya gbara ya ume ka ya na ndị ọzọ kerịta ihe osise ya. [3] Bagshaw malitere inwekwu obi ike na ọrụ ya dị ka onye na-ese ihe, mgbe usoro nzaghachi dị mma sochiri.",
        "Ọ nwụrụ n'ihi ọrịa kansa na February 14, 1973, na Detroit. A kọwapụtara Griffin n'akwụkwọ ọkọwa okwu ndị Africa American Architects: A Biographic Dictionary, 1865-1945 (2004).",
        "Barbee akụkọ, na February 20, 1895, Blanche E. Stover nke Luray. Ya na ụmụ anọ: Herbert Randolph, Aurelia Loreta, Mary Frances, na William Clifford. [1] Barbee biri n na-akpọ a na-akpọ \"Calendine\", nke e wuru na 1850 ka ọ bụrụ ụlọ ọrụ izugbe na-ekiri n'ihe Sperryville - New Market turnpike; ọ na-eji ebe mbụ ụlọ egwuregwu dị ka studio ya. [2] E liri ya n'ebe a na-eli ozu Stover dị na Luray. [3] \"Calendine\" ka na-eso; A na-egosi ya site na akara nrịbama ihe mere eme nke Page County Historical Society wuru, bụ nke ezinụlọ ụlọ ahụ na 1968 [2] na nke na-arụ ọrụ taa dị ka ụlọ ihe mgbe ochie",
        "Na 1938, Hoffman si aro Belskie na-edepụta Robert Latou Dickinson . [1] : 18 Ha aka ụdị ụdị nke e na-egosi na ngosi ụwa nke New York nke 1939. A bịara mara ihe ọkpụkpụ ndị a dị ka Dickinson-Belskie Birth Series, bụ nke echiche ewu ewu na ngwere ahụ, ma n 'oge na-ahụ anya hụghachi ya maka ngosi zuru ụwa ọnụ. [1]: 11–18 [2] N'ime iri na-achọ, ndị a afọ ga-ahụ ihe oriri otu esi ekiri ndị ọzọ zuru ezu, ngwaọrụ site na ọnwụ Dickinson. [1] : 19",
        "Na 1994, Epps kwagara na telivishọn, na-eduzi ihe omume nke mgbede Shade . Ihe nzere telivishọn ya ndị ọzọ gụnyere Smart Guy, Nwanne nwanyị, Nwanyị, Frasier, Onye ọ bụla hụrụ Raymond n'anya, Enyi, enyi nwanyị na George Lopez .",
        "Nathaniel Choate (1899-1965) bụ onye America na-ese ihe na onye na-ese ihe bụ onye jere ozi dị ka osote onye isi oche nke National Sculpture Society . [1] Choate ji ihe dị iche iche ọrụ, aluminum, bronze, marble, na onyx. Ọ na mfe ọrụ na National Academy of Design na New York City na Pennsylvania Academy of the Fine Arts na Philadelphia, Pennsylvania . National Academy of Design hoputara ya onye okachamara ihe na 1955. [2] Na 1961, Society of Medalists nyere nri nrite 64th ha na obere ya. Choate mmetụta ihe nrite Mgbasa Ozi Mba sitere na Association Mgbasa Ozi N' akara America .",
        "O kpebiri ịnwale ụdị egwu ọhụrụ ahụ, na 1984, wepụtara obere album Rastas Never Die . Ndekọ ahụ rere nke ọma—ihe dị ka nkeji 4,000—tụnyere nkeji 30,000 ndekọ mbaqanga ya ga-ere. N'ịchọ ịkwụsị mmegide ịkpa ókè agbụrụ, ndị ọchịchị machibidoro album ahụ na 1985, n'ihi egwu egwu ya dị egwu, dị ka na egwu \"Agha na Mpụ\". Otú ọ dị, Dube enweghị nkụda mmụọ, ma nọgide na-eme egwu reggae na-ebi ndụ ma dee ma mepụta album reggae nke abụọ, Chee echiche banyere Ụmụaka, na 1985. Ọ nwetara ọkwa ahịa Platinum wee guzobe Dube dị ka onye na-ese reggae a ma ama na South Africa, na mgbakwunye na ịdọta uche na mpụga ala nna ya.",
        "Thomas Jefferson, Mahadum Wichita State, Wichita, Kansas, 1975.",
        "Saya Woolfalk na-anọchite anya Leslie Tonkonow Artworks & Projects, New York . Ọ bụ onye ndụmọdụ gụsịrị akwụkwọ na Art Institute of Chicago na onye nkatọ BFA na Parsons School of Design na 2012. Ọ bụkwa onye omenkà nleta na Montclair State University na 2012 na 2013. Woolfalk bụ onye prọfesọ na Parsons site na 2013 ruo 2018.",
        "Gilbert Lafayette Laws (March 11, 1838 - April 25, 1907) bụ onye ndọrọ ndọrọ ọchịchị America, onye na emeputa akwukwo nzisa ozi, na onye na azuahia. Oruru oru dika onye ode akwukwo nke state na dika onye otu United States of Representatives N'oge 1800s.",
        "Martini nyere aka guzobe otu ndị na-ese ihe n'ọhịa na Atlanta n'ime afọ 1950 na mmalite afọ 1960 ma duzie Edward Daugherty, FASLA onye rụrụ ọrụ n'ọfịs ahụ n'oge ọkọchị ya mgbe ọ na-agụ akwụkwọ na Harvard's GSD (1948-1951). Daugherty kwuru na ndị ọzọ na-ese ụkpụrụ ụlọ na Atlanta na-arụ ọrụ yiri nke ahụ n'oge ahụ gụnyere H. Boyer Marx na Willard Byrd. Site na 1963-1965, Martini bụ onye isi oche nke abụọ nke American Society of Landscape Architects wee sonye na ndị ọzọ dị iche iche n'oge ọrụ ya gụnyere American Institute of City Planners, American Society of Planning Officials, Urban Land Institute, Georgia Engineering Society. , American Planning and Civic Association, na Atlanta Chamber of Commerce .",
        "N'ihe gbasara nyocha gburugburu ebe obibi maka omume ụfọdụ n'okpuru iwu ọrụ ugbo US, \"Okwu anụmanụ pụtara otu ihe atụ maka ọrụ inye anụmanụ ọ bụla gbakọrọ site na ịgbakwunye ọnụ ọgụgụ ndị a: ọnụ ọgụgụ nke igbu ehi na-enye nri mụbara site na 1.0, gbakwunyere ọnụ ọgụgụ nke ehi tozuru etozu mụbara site n'aka 1.4, gbakwunyie ọnụ ọgụgụ nke ezì dị ihe karịrị kilogram 25 (ihe dị ka pound 55) mụbara site iti 0.4, gbakwunye ọnụ ọgụgụ atụrụ mụbara site ci 0.1, gbakwunyụba ọnụ ọgụgụ nke ịnyịnya mụbara site. \"",
        "Boswell na Holland, gụnyere akwụkwọ ozi ya na Belle de Zuylen (Zélide) . [Ihe e dere n'ala ala peeji] Frederick Pottle 428 p. London: William Heinemann, 1952.&nbsp;",
        "Ichebe ahụike nke ụmụ anụmanụ pụọ na egwu siri ike, dị ka:",
        "Na mbụ aka izugbe nke 1999 Patricia Kaliati ka a mgbaàmà onye otu nzuko omeiwu maka Mulanje West Constituency na tiketi United Democratic Front, ọnọdụ ọ na-aga n'ihu. [2] N'afọ 2000, a na-amụ ya osote onye pastọ na ụmụaka Bakili Muluzi . Akpọrọ Kaliati ka ọ bụrụ osote onye minista na-ahụ maka mmemme ọha na eze (2002–2004) wee bụrụ onye osote onye isi obodo. Akụkọ ya ọzọ na 2004 wee pụta Minister of Information and Tourism, renamed Minister of Information and Civic Education na May 2007, na-ejide ikike ahụ ruo Mee 2009.",
        "Apple pomace abụwo nri ọdịnala maka ụdị anụ ụlọ dị iche iche. A na-agba ume iji mkpụrụ vaịn eme ihe dị ka nri anụ ụlọ iji belata ntọhapụ nke nhazi mkpụrụ vaịn fọdụrụ na gburugburu ebe obibi, nke nwere ike iduga na mmetọ siri ike.",
        "Polish Initiative bụ òtù na-aga n'ihu, nke nwere nnwere onwe mmekọrịta mmadụ na ibe ya, na nke na-akwado Ọchịchị onye kwuo uche ya. Ọ na-anọdụ n'etiti aka ekpe gaa n'aka ekpe na ndọrọ ndọrọ ọchịchị.",
        "Ndị odeakwụkwọ mpaghara Ọchịchị ime obodo gọọmenti Akko, Kumo,Gombe Steeti, Nigeria [3] Local Akko dị n'okpuru Gombe steeti, ma onye na-achị ugbu a bụ Alhaji Muhammad Inuwa Yahaya, na-achị n'okpuru otu esi enweta All Progressives Congress (APC)",
        "Domenico \"Mimmo\" Di Carlo (amụrụ 23 Maachị 1964) bụ onye nkuzi bọọlụ Italy na onye bụbu onye ọkpụkpọ.",
        "Mitra lụrụ Shobori Ganguly. O nwere ụmụ nwoke abụọ Kushan na Shakya site n'alụmdi na nwunye mbụ. Ọ bụ onye hụrụ nri n'anya nke ukwuu ma a na-ewere ya dị ka onye nwere ikike na egwu ihe nkiri India na Rabindra Sangeet. Mitra nwụrụ na 1 Septemba 2021 mgbe ọ dị afọ 66 n'ụlọ ya na Sainik Farm, na Delhi. Ọtụtụ ndị nta akụkọ toro ọrụ ya na-akpụzi ọrụ nke ndị ọrụ ibe ya na-eto eto.",
        "'n Vaste plek vir Afrikaans (Co-author: Lawrence Schlemmer), Protea Boekhuis, 2006",
        "Onye isi ala Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva katọrọ ihe ọ kpọrọ \"àgwà nchedo\" nke achịbishọp n'okwu ebe ndị dọkịta kwuru na ha na-anwa ịzọpụta ndụ nwa agbọghọ ahụ, na-agbakwụnye, sị: \"N'okwu a, ọrụ ahụike ziri ezi karịa Chọọchị\"",
        "Site na Barcelona, With Love (Mac Reilly # 4) (2012)",
        "Na 1 Samuel 25, Nabali gosipụtara enweghị ekele n'ebe Devid, nwa Jesse (nke si n'ebo Juda), na Abigail na-anwa ime ka obi dị Devid mma, iji gbochie Eze ga-abịa ịbọ ọbọ. Ọ na-enye ya nri, ma na-agwa ya okwu, na-agba ya ume ka ọ ghara \"nwere na akọ na uche ya nnukwu ibu arọ nke ịwụfu ọbara na-enweghị isi\" (amaokwu 31, NIV) ma na-echetara ya na Chineke ga-eme ya \"ndị eze na-adịgide adịgide\" (amazi 28). Jon Levenson na-akpọ nke a \"nkwupụta a na-apụghị ịgbagha agbagha\" nke amụma Nathan na 2 Samuel 7. Alice Bach na-ekwu na Abigail na-ekwupụta \"amụma dị mkpa, \" na Talmud na-ele ya anya dị ka otu n'ime ndị amụma nwanyị asaa nke Tanakh. Otú ọ dị, Levenson na-atụ aro na ọ \"na-eche na akụkọ ihe mere eme\" sitere na ọgụgụ isi kama site na mkpughe pụrụ iche.",
        "Site na 1951 ruo 1994, ọ rụrụ ọrụ n'ụlọ ọgwụ maka Ekpenta n'obodo nta Buluba, nso Lake Victoria na Uganda, ebe, ruo 1983, ọ bụ onye isi dọkịta. Na mbido, obere ụlọ ọrụ nke ndị Irish Franciscans na-elekọta, ụlọ ọrụ ahụ toro ghọọ ụlọ ọgwụ na ọzụzụ nke oge a nwere ụlọ ọgwụ 100 na alaka ụmụaka, ụlọ nyocha, ụlọ maka ndị ekpenta na ụka, nke a maara ugbu a dị ka Ụlọ Ọgwụ Buluba. Na mgbakwunye na ọzụzụ maka ndị dibịa, Dr. Błeńska malitere ma hazie ihe ọmụmụ maka ndị na-elekọta ndị ekpenta (Nkụzi Ọzụzụ Ndị Enyemaka ekpenta). Na Buluba, Dr. Błeńska na ndị dọkịta Poland ndị ọzọ rụkọrọ ọrụ: Bohdan Kozłowski, Wanda Marczak-Malczewska, Elżbieta Kołakowska, Dr. Henryk Nowak. Ọrụ ya ogologo oge nyere ya aha otutu \"Nne nke ekpenta\".",
        "Nwa mbụ nke Finn, Michael, lụrụ Sarah Williams na 1796, ada nke onye na-ere akwụkwọ Dublin James Williams (nwụrụ 1786). Michael mere mgbalị na-emeghị nke ọma iji na-azụ ahịa obibi nke nne ya, na-agbanwe ụda nke Journal ma ghara ime nke ọma itinye akwụkwọ maka ntinye akwụkwọ gọọmentị.",
        "Na 1997, Palmer kwagara Hamilton nwa oge wee kpọọ ụlọ ọrụ Mahadum Waikato yana na-anọchite anya Waikato . Ọ laghachiri na Dunedin na 1998 ebe ọ gbara maka Alhambra Union . N'afọ ahụ ọ chịkọtara Black ferns na mmeri na 1998 Women's Rugby World Cup . N'afọ ahụ, New Zealand Rugby Union nyere ya onye ọkpụkpọ kachasị mma nke ụmụ nwanyị. Ọ gụchara PhD ya na 2000, na 2001 kwagara Palmerston North iji nweta ọkwa na njikwa egwuregwu na Mahadum Massey. N'ebe ahụ ọ sonyeere ụlọ ịgba rugby Kia Toa . Palmer gara n'ihu bụrụ onye isi ndị Black Ferns wee duru ha gaa n'asọmpi ụwa nke abụọ na 2002 .",
        "Ili Amanitakaye nwere pyramid nwere ụlọ ekpere na ụlọ ili ozu n'okpuru ala. N'ime ụlọ ekpere ahụ, a ka nwere stela. E nwere steepụ na-aga n'okpuru ala ma na-eduga n'ọnụ ụlọ ili ozu abụọ. A chọtara ili ahụ na-ezu ohi, mana a chọtara iberibe nke ọ dịkarịa ala shabtis 89. Ha na-ebu aha na utu aha nke eze nwanyị. A chọpụtakwara ọtụtụ arịa, yana ihe ncheta faience nwere aha ya na aha eze Malonaqen. Nke a nwere ike igosi na ọ bụ nne ya. Ihe ọzọ, cylinder electrum, bu aha ya, yana inye ya aha Nwanne nwanyị eze.",
        "N'afọ 2006, AAC chepụtara atụmatụ maka imepụta mkpokọta mkpokọta aha, nke ga-abụ onye nnọchi anya ma na-achịkwa Ọkachamara Ihe owuwu na mba South Afrịka ma na-ahụ maka ọrụ nhazi na nhazi nke achọrọ iji webata mmemme mba mbụ.",
        "2023 - RAMfest (1 Septemba) na Cape Town, RAMfest (2 Septemba) na Pretoria.",
        "Okwu a bụ n'ikpeazụ ikpe nke shọr nke egwuregwu 'nri, nnu' na baa nke ihe 'isi nri, gruel, spoon-anụ'.[1] Nke mbụ sitere Ndị Parthian 意 šōr nke ere 'nri', na nke ikpeazụ sitere na Middle Persian *-bāg nke ihe 'obi , spoon-anụ'.",
        "Asha Ismail (amuru 27 Septemba 1968) bu onye na-akwado ikike mmadu Kenya. Ọ bụ onye nchoputa na onye isi oche Save a Girl, Save a Generation, otu nke ebumnuche ya bụ ịkwụsị ibi ụmụ nwanyị ibe, usoro iwu ego, alụmdi na nwunye mmanye na mmegbu ndị ọzọ a na-emegbu ụmụ nwanyị na Africa na Asia.",
        "Ihe kachasị elu nke uri ahụ na-ewere ọnọdụ na ahịrị 28:",
        "Ụda Proto-Tai–Kadai nwetara nkewa n'ime Bouyei ọgbara ọhụrụ, nke egosiri na tebụl na-esote.",
        "Ojiji mbụ e ji okwu xeroxlore bụ na edemede Michael J. Preston bụ \"Xerox-lore\", 1974.[1] \"Photocopylore\" nwere ike ịbụ aha a na-ezutekarị maka ihe a na-ahụkarị ugbu a, n'ihi nchegbu ụghalaahịa metụtara ụlọ ọrụ Xerox. Ojiji mbụ nke okwu a bịara na A Dictionary of English Folklore nke Jacqueline Simpson na Steve Roud dere..",
        "Onye edemede akụkọ, onye nchịkọta , onye nchịkọta , Douglas Hill kwu mfe Shah na ndị na-eme ihe na-atọ ụtọ, ahụ na-eme ka onye na-agụ ya nwee \"ụzọ n nsogbu okwu na eziokwu na-achọta eziokwu.\".",
        "A na-emezigharị aha ndị dị na Djaru ma ọ bụrụ na ha bụ ngwá ọrụ, ndị obodo, ndị nnata, ma ọ bụ ndị nọ n'ọnọdụ ndị na-adịghị mma. Okwu 'ergative' na-ezo aka n'ụdị dị n'ime nkwuwa okwu njakịrị-absolutive nke ihe ndị dị n'ahịrịokwu na-agbanwe agbanwe na isiokwu nke ahịrịokwu na-agbanwe agbanwe anaghị morphologically dabara na isiokwu nke ahịrịokwu intransitive. Ya bụ, n'asụsụ na-enweghị isi, ọ bụrụ na aha na ọnọdụ isiokwu intransitive (ma ọ bụ ọnọdụ ihe ntụgharị) bụ X, mgbe ahụ ọ ga-abụ Y na ọnọdụ isiokwu ntụgharị. Enwere ike ịhụ ihe atụ nke usoro ihe nhụsianya-absolutive maka aha na Djaru na Tsunoda 1981:",
        "Emume a na-eme ka ndị ugwu biri n'oge oyi siri ike, nke karịrị ọnwa anọ n'akụkụ ụfọdụ nke mpaghara ahụ. Ha na-echefu abalị oyi na oyi na-atụ ma na-enwe obi ụtọ na mmemme ahụ.A na-agbaso omenala nke ọma ma gbuo ụmụ anụmanụ na 21 Disemba.",
        "N'oge ọrịa COVID-19 na Eswatini, Mabuza kpaliri gọọmentị iwere ndị nkuzi 900 ọzọ iji nyere ụlọ akwụkwọ aka ịmalitegharị mgbe mkpọchi mba ahụ gasịrị.[1] Ọ gbara ụmụ akwụkwọ na ndị nkuzi ume ịnata ọgwụ mgbochi COVID-19 ka ụlọ akwụkwọ nwee ike imepegharị yana mmemme mmemme maka ụmụ akwụkwọ wee maliteghachi.[2] O kelere ụlọ ọrụ nnọchi anya Qatar dị na Eswatini maka inye ụmụ akwụkwọ enyemaka n'oge ọrịa a.",
        "mmadụ 443 ndị a nyochara na-ekwu na ha na-asụ asụsụ ahụ, n'agbanyeghị na ọtụtụ n'ime ha anaghị asụ ya dị ka asụsụ obodo ha. A na-eji ya dị ka asụsụ asụsụ n'ahịa karịa n'ụlọ. n'agbanyeghị na ọtụtụ n'ime ha anaghị asụ ya dị ka",
        "The Pattern of Poverty in Ghana, 1988-1992: A Study Based on the Ghana Living Standards Survey (1995), ya na Harold Coulombe, Andrew McKay, Moses Avooner-Williams et al., Accra: Ghana Statistical Service",
        "Eze nwanyị ahụ kwupụtara Fortuné n'ụzọ doro anya. Mgbe Fortuné jụrụ ya, ọ wakporo ya na onwe ya wee kpọọ maka enyemaka, na-ekwu na ọ wakporo ye na mmerụ ahụ ya sitere na nguzogide ya. A mara Fortuné ikpe ka a maa ya mma ọnwụ, mana iwepụ uwe ahụ kpughere na ọ bụ nwanyị. Eze lụrụ ya.",
        "Dị ka ihe atụ, na Avar Arabic Script, e mepụtala ụdị anọ nke mkpụrụedemede yāʼ (\"ی\"), nke ọ bụla nwere ọrụ pụrụ iche.",
        "chọrọ opekata mpe mkpụrụokwu abụọ, nke na-egosipụta ụkpụrụ nrụgide a. Ụfọdụ akọwawo",
        "Yankurije na-asọmpi maka APR Athletics Club; tupu 2016, ọ na-asọ mpi na Nyamasheke Athletics club . Ọ malitere egwuregwu mgbe ọ dị afọ iri na otu. Ọ malitere na 2014 Kigali half marathon, na-emecha nke ise, ma mesịa n'afọ ahụ, ọ gara asọmpi na 2014 African Cross Country Championship, na-emeri nke 35. Ọ bịara nke anọ na ihe omume ọkara marathon na 2017 Kigali International Peace Marathon wee merie ihe omume 20 kilomita (12 mi) na Bugesera . Yankurije meriri ihe omume mita 10,000 na 2018 Rwandan National Championships. N'otu afọ ahụ, ọ meriri Rwandan National Cross-Country Championships, wee bụrụ nke atọ na Ịnara marathon na 2018 Kigali International Peace Marathon, na Dar Marathon na Tanzania.",
        "A na-atụkwa aro na ụdị akụkọ ATU 301 na ụdị ya Jean de l'Ours, ATU 650 (\"Strong Hans\"), ATU 302 (\" Obi Ekwensu n'ime Egg\") na ATU 554 (\"Anụmanụ Ndị Na-enwe ekele\") nwere ike ịnwe otu akụkọ na-esighị ike, mana, ka oge na-aga, ụdị akụkọ ahụ dị iche.",
        "Ka ọ na-erule 1964, ọrụ ịgba egwu ya abanyela na fim. George Cukor nwere mmasị na ya nke ukwuu na, ewezuga akụkụ ịgba egwu ya na My Fair Lady, o nyere ya obere ọrụ dị ka Magpie na mpaghara agbụrụ ya na Rex Harrison na Audrey Hepburn . O nwetara onye nnọchi anya ma gbanwee aha ya ka ọ bụrụ Victoria Carroll n'ihi na enweelarị ndị na-eme ihe nkiri aha ya bụ Mary Ford na Carol Lee Ford debara aha na SAG .",
        "A mụrụ Martin na Ballylongford, County Kerry, Ireland, site na ezinụlọ nke etiti [1] nke a zụlitere ụmụaka na-asụ Irish na tebụl nri abalị. Nne na nna ya, Conor na Katherine Fitzmaurice Martin, nwere ụmụ nwoke ise na ụmụ nwanyị ise. Anọ n'ime ụmụ nwoke ise ahụ ghọrọ ndị ụkọchukwu, gụnyere nwanne ya nwoke nke nta, Francis Xavier Martin.",
        "O ji ọnọdụ a ruo mgbe ọ lara ezumike nká. Ọ rụkwara ọrụ dịka onye ndu na National Council on Women and Development na dịka onye na-ahụ maka mgbasa ozi nke United Nations Development Programme (UNDP). [1]",
        "Asụsụ Gweno na The Endangered Languages Project",
        "Wade gwara Chemistry World na o kwenyere na ihe ndị dị otú ahụ ndị na-eme nchọpụta sayensị hapụrụ na Wikipedia bụ ihe mwute, na-ekwu na ọ na-anabata ntinye maka ọbụna ndị mgbasa ozi a ma ama. Ka ọ na-erule Jenụwarị 2020, e nwere nkwekọrịta iji weghachite isiokwu ahụ, ebe ọ bụ na n'oge ahụ, isi mmalite ọhụrụ adịla. Ka ọ na-erule 2019, n'ime isiokwu 600 banyere ụmụ nwanyị sayensị Wade dere, ehichapụla 6 maka ịghara izute ụkpụrụ Wikipedia maka ama ama.",
        "Astragalus inopinatus Boriss. (Fabaceae)",
        "Akwụkwọ a nwetara nnabata dị mma n'ozuzu site n'aka ndị nyocha akwụkwọ na ndị na-agụ akwụkwọ. Was a Ihe nlebanya nwere kpakpando sitere na Kirkus Reviews kpọrọ akwụkwọ akụkọ ahụ \"ihe na-adọrọ mmasị na akụkụ gbara ọchịchịrị nke enyi nwanyị\". Ntụleghachi ọzọ nke NPR kwuru na \" Wahala bụ ihe na-atọ ụtọ ma mara oke mma n'otú o si ewepụta ụfọdụ isi okwu na ibi ndụ obodo ọgbara ọhụrụ\". Ntụleghachi sitere n'aka ndị mbipụta kwa izu kwuru na \"nchọgharị nke agbụrụ na okike nke May na-eme ka nke a na-enye ume ọhụrụ.\"",
        "Nyocha dị mma nke omume ịchọ ahụike n'etiti na inye iwu maka ụmụ nwoke na-enwe mmekọahụ na ụmụ nwoke na Malawi.",
        "Catão, ihe nkiri ọdachi nke Pedro Metastasio (nke a sụgharịrị site na Italian). Ụdị. na akwụkwọ nke B. X. P. de Sousa, 1860. 136 peeji.",
        "(ya na Lucy Shepard Freeland) University of California Publications in Linguistics. Mpịakọta nke 23 nke mbipụta Mahadum California na asụsụ. Mahadum nke California Press. 1960. ISSN 0068-6484.&nbsp;",
        "A na-asụ ya n'etiti ọtụtụ Ndị Arab bi na Central Asia na ndị na-akwagharị akwagharị bụ ndị kwagara ebe ahụ mgbe ọdịda nke Alaeze Ukwu Sasanian. Ha biri n'ebe ndị dị na Samarkand, Bukhara, Qashqadarya, Surkhandarya (Uzbekistan ugbu a), na Khatlon (Tajikistan ugbu a). Ìgwè ndị Arab mbụ kwagara n'ógbè a na narị afọ nke asatọ n'oge Mmeri ndị Alakụba ma mesịa bụrụ ndị otu ndị Arab si Balkh na Andkhoy (Afghanistan nke oge a) sonyeere. Dị ka Ibn Al-Athir si kwuo, ndị mmeri Arab biri ihe dị ka ezinụlọ ndị Arab 50,000 na Khorasan nke Iran, Northern Afghanistan na ndịda Turkmenistan nke oge a, mana ọnụ ọgụgụ ahụ bụ nke a na-emebiga ókè. Arabic ghọrọ asụsụ sayensị na azụmahịa nke oge ahụ. Ọtụtụ ndị Arab nke Central Asia bi n'obodo ndị dịpụrụ adịpụ ma ha anaghị akwado alụmdi na nwunye na ndị bi n'ógbè ahụ. Ihe a nyeere asụsụ ha aka ịdịgide n'ọtụtụ asụsụ ruo na narị afọ nke 20. Ka ọ na-erule afọ 1880, ọtụtụ ndị Arab na-azụ anụ kwagara n'ebe ugwu Afghanistan site n'ihe bụ Uzbekistan na Tajikistan ugbu a mgbe RRussian Central Asia. Ndị Arab a anaghị asụ Arabic n'oge a, ebe ha gbanwere DDari Uzbek.[2]",
        "Puithey (16&nbsp;km southeast of Pulo-babi)",
        "\"Ya mere, onyenwe m, ọ bụrụ na nwoke ahụ echefuo, ma ọ keleghị gị maka ihe niile i meere ya, naanị n'ihi na i meghị ihe ọ chọrọ, ana m adụ gị ọdụ ka ị ghara ime ihe ọ bụla iji merụọ ya ahụ. Ana m adụkwa gị ọdụ ka ọ bụrụ na mmadụ meere gị ihe ọma, mana o meghị ihe niile ị chọrọ, echefula ihe ọma onye ahụ meere gị.\"",
        "Tupu ụbọchị ncheta St Columba, 9 Jun 1963, Shaw chọpụtara na Bishọp Stephen McGill nke Catholic Diocese nke Argyll na Isles, onye Glaswegia họọrọ adaeze Anglo-Saxon yana Lolo St Margaret nke Scotland dị ka onye nsọ nke mba, jụrụ ime emume ncheta otu puku afọ na narị anọ na nke mbata St. Columba site na Gaelic Ireland dị ka onye ozi si ala ọzọ nke Ndị Kraịst bịa Scotland. N'ikpebi iji akọ ịma Bishọp aka site na ememe nke ha, Shaw na onye ụkọchukwu parish nke St. Columba's Catholic Church n'elu Canna mere ndokwa maka Mas dị elu nke Tridentine dị nsọ nke Benediction Eucharistic ga-esochi maka ọnụ ọgụgụ dị ukwuu nke ndị njem ala nsọ ji ụgbọ mmiri bịarute site na Rùm, Eigg, na Mallaig.",
        "A na-egosi obosara nke mmasị ya, ikike, na àgwà ya site n'ihe odide ya fọdụrụnụ na akaebe nke ndị enyi ya lanarịrị. O nwere mmasị na akwụkwọ, akụkọ ihe mere eme, ihe osise, ọdịdị ala, mmekọrịta mmadụ na ibe ya, na ngalaba teknụzụ. A na-ebipụta magazin Vedem na Fraịdee ọ bụla ruo afọ abụọ.",
        "Biliary Microlithiasis nwere ike ịchọpụta site na ultrasound site na iji ngwa ngwa Rotation Ultrasound Protocol",
        "Mgbe ọ dọtara mmasị nke ọtụtụ klọb ndị a ma ama gburugburu ụwa, na Septemba 9, 2021, Dumornay sonyeere Reims n'ụzọ iwu kwadoro na nkwekọrịta na-adịgide adịgide, wee bịanye aka na nkwekọrịta ọkachamara mbụ ya na klọb French.",
        "Malenzapa nwụrụ na Disemba 23, 2025. E mere olili ozu ya na Jenụwarị 17, 2026, Touadera wee bịa.",
        "N'ọnwa Juun afọ 2018, a kpọrọ aha ya n'ime ndị otu iri abụọ na atọ nke Naijiria maka iko mba ụwa nke afọ 2018 na Russia.",
        "N'abalị iri na atọ n'ọnwa Ọgọstụ nke afọ 2023, ya na ụmụ nwanyị Charity nke Saint Vincent de Paul kwekọrịtara nkwa. Krapić arụwo ọrụ dị ka onye nta akụkọ na onye na-eme ihe ngosi redio maka Radio Trsat na onye na - onye enyemaka iwu maka ụmụ nwanyị dab ara n'ihi ike nke mmegbu ime ihe ike dabere na okike na \"Saint Anne\" Caritas shelter na maka ndị a na-akpa oke na Social Welfare Centre na Rijeka, yana onye ọrụ nkwukọrịta nke Archdiocese nke Rijeka . N'afọ ahụ, ọ sonyeere Vatican's Dicastery for Communication .",
        "Abayi Umu-okoroato bụ obodo dị na Obingwa mpaghara gọọmentị nke Abia Steeti, Naịjirịa .",
        "Jaoui nọ na mmekọrịta ịhụnanya na Jean-Pierre Bacri site na 1987 ruo 2012. Mgbe ha kewasịrị, ha abụọ gara n’ihu ịnọ n’udo ma nọgidekwa na-arụkọ ọrụ ọnụ.",
        "N'ime usoro nke Iwu 26.743 na Gender Identity, na mkpebi akụkọ ihe mere eme, a ghọtara okike ya dị ka onye na-anọghị na binary okike. Mkpebi dị peeji iri na abụọ nke onye ọka ikpe obodo Myriam Cataldi kwuru na na asambodo ọmụmụ na ID nke Bertolini ga-akwanyere njirimara nwoke na nwanyị ùgwù: \"Femineidad travesti\" (transl. Travesti Feminity).",
        "Wayeyi ebiela n'ógbè dị gburugburu Seronga yana mpaghara ndịda gbara gburugburu Maun, na ole na ole Wayeyi bi n'ụlọ nna nna ha dị na Caprivi Strip. N'ime afọ iri abụọ gara aga, ọtụtụ mmadụ si n'akụkụ niile nke Okavango akwagaala Maun, n'ọgwụgwụ afọ 1960 na mmalite afọ 1970, ihe karịrị ndị gbara ọsọ ndụ Hambukushu 4,000 si Angola biri n'ógbè dị gburugburu Etsha na ọdịda anyanwụ Panhandle.",
        "Usoro gburugburu ebe obibi mmiri mmiri dị na mpaghara ndị dị elu nke Ugwu Kenya na-enye usoro nzacha mmiri eke, ụdị osisi na anụmanụ dị iche iche, yana ihe oriri maka ụdị na gburugburu ebe obibi ndị ọzọ niile. N'ihi mmụba nke ndị mmadụ n'oge na-adịbeghị anya, ala mmiri dị na Kenya emebiela, ebe obibi aghọwokwa ihe mgbochi dị ukwuu nye ọrụ gburugburu ebe obibi."
    ]
}
